y Changes:\n- コミットメント保証 → スマート予約割引\n- コミットメントコスト → 予約割引コスト\n- 返金 → コスト還元\n- 30日保証 → 30日プラン\n- 1年保証 → 1年プラン\n- 保証プラン → スマート予約割引プラン\n- 保証期間 → プラン期間\n\nFiles Changed (13 files):\n- app/layout.tsx: Page title\n- components/Header.tsx: Header title\n- components/SimulationConfig.tsx: Plan selection labels and notes\n- components/ui/CostCards.tsx: Card title and refund labels\n- components/ui/CumulativeChart.tsx: Chart labels and legends\n- components/ui/MonthlyChart.tsx: Chart label\n- components/ui/DetailsTable.tsx: Table column headers\n- components/ui/DiscountRateInfo.tsx: Modal content and plan descriptions\n- components/ui/RevenueForecastReport.tsx: Table headers and comments\n- components/ui/RevenueHighlight.tsx: Card title and comparison text\n- components/ui/CustomerCostComparison.tsx: Section title and features\n- lib/simulator.ts: Plan name generation\n- lib/types.ts: Type comments\n\nImpact:\n- Improved clarity and consistency\n- Better reflects product positioning as smart reservation discount\n- Maintains all functionality while updating user-facing terminology","tree":{"sha":"9d355afd7d8508065d2825aa0f149ced5452a36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/9d355afd7d8508065d2825aa0f149ced5452a36f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/48579f6eb1c9cac26dbc27fd0db59228f247a187","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":