"email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"docs: Update discount rate info with 1-year guarantee logic changes\n\nChanges:\n- Updated Insurance Commitment notes to reflect 1-year guarantee RDS pricing\n  - 30-day: EC2 = ComputeSP 3yr, others = RI 3yr NoUpfront\n  - 1-year: EC2 = ComputeSP 3yr, RDS = RI 3yr PartialUpfront (with upfront), others = RI 3yr NoUpfront\n- Added note about upfront cost for 1-year guarantee with RDS\n- Updated Standard RI/SP notes to clarify fallback behavior\n  - Compute SP: non-supported services use RI NoUpfront (based on term)\n  - EC2 Instance SP: non-EC2 resources use RI 3yr NoUpfront\n- Updated service support section footer with clear fallback rules\n\nImpact:\n- Better transparency about upfront costs\n- Clear documentation of pricing calculation logic\n- Improved user understanding of guarantee plan variations","tree":{"sha":"4987c352f2afada16997c4040c5858e47aafc9db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/4987c352f2afada16997c4040c5858e47aafc9db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/e4c52b6c10b734dad6d795d009329e46005c51e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gith