\nRemove all remaining instances of ''保険'' (insurance) terminology and replace\nwith consistent product naming. This completes the terminology update started\nin the previous commit.\n\nChanges:\n1. DetailsTable.tsx: ''保険削減額'' → ''保証削減額''\n2. RevenueHighlight.tsx: ''保険 vs 標準'' → ''保証 vs 標準'', ''保険が有利'' → ''保証が有利''\n3. RevenueForecastReport.tsx:\n   - Comment: ''保険プラン'' → ''保証プラン''\n   - Comment: ''保険期間'' → ''保証期間''\n   - UI text: All instances updated\n4. simulator.ts: Plan name ''保険コミットメント'' → ''コミットメント保証''\n5. types.ts: Comment ''保険期間'' → ''保証期間''\n\nVerification:\n- Searched entire codebase for ''保険'' - no remaining instances\n- Build successful\n- All references now use ''保証'' (guarantee) terminology\n\nResult:\nComplete terminology consistency across the application with no legacy\n''insurance'' terms remaining in Japanese text.","tree":{"sha":"2ebfb8a75f62f5acda8b5c46f40aab23a855bb22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/2ebfb8a75f62f5acda8b5c46f40aab23a855bb22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/3a3ce8c19d5436e78139a44730a4fab969a8576f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/r