.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/136b1fbb7f6be9d3eed5570fb4026147e636ee7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T14:01:35Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T14:01:35Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"refactor: Update terminology for insurance commitment and premium\n\nUpdate product terminology across the application to align with business requirements:\n- 保険コミットメント → コミットメント保証 (Insurance Commitment → Commitment Guarantee)\n- 保険料 → リスクプレミアム料 (Insurance Premium → Risk Premium Fee)\n\nThis change improves clarity and better reflects the nature of the product offering.\n\nChanges applied across:\n- Page title and header (layout.tsx, Header.tsx)\n- Simulation configuration UI (SimulationConfig.tsx)\n- Cost display cards (CostCards.tsx)\n- Charts and graphs (CumulativeChart.tsx, MonthlyChart.tsx)\n- Data tables (DetailsTable.tsx)\n- Revenue reports (RevenueForecastReport.tsx, RevenueHighlight.tsx)\n- Discount rate information (DiscountRateInfo.tsx)\n- Customer cost comparison (CustomerCostComparison.tsx)\n- Type definitions and comments (types.ts)\n\nTotal files updated: 12 files\nTerminology changes: 2 terms replaced throughout UI and documentation\n\nImpact:\n- Consistent terminology across all user-facing text\n- Better alignment with business product naming\n- Improved clarity for end users and stakeholders","tree":{"sha":"cc97b5299374666b2df6395838b30a7afb5addf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/cc97b5299374666b2df6395838b30a7afb5addf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/136b1fbb7f6be9d3eed5570fb4026147e636ee7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","