gs Plans with fallback to RI NoUpfront\n2. EC2 Instance Savings Plans with fallback to RI 3yr NoUpfront for non-EC2\n\nThe calculation logic now correctly handles all service combinations,\nmaking this warning unnecessary and potentially confusing.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed warning box in ResourceSelector component\n- Kept helpful tips section for resource selection guidance\n\nRationale:\nThe simulator has proper fallback logic for all scenarios:\n- Compute SP: Uses SP pricing or falls back to RI NoUpfront\n- EC2-SP: Uses EC2 Instance SP for EC2, RI 3yr NoUpfront for non-EC2\n- Mixed services are now fully supported with accurate calculations","tree":{"sha":"2aac1e44b87e3805ab408df87a2d5d2a9e3a10d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/2aac1e44b87e3805ab408df87a2d5d2a9e3a10d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/906f42d73b9ad029353cf47d4e14824af07480fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","