","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/446c6922f585a25a75fe0058d2e92d8efe30efab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T11:57:25Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T11:57:25Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"feat: Use actual Tokyo region pricing for EC2 Instance Savings Plans\n\nEC2 Instance Savings Plans now use actual AWS pricing data from Tokyo region\ninstead of generic discount rates. This provides more accurate cost estimates\nbased on real-world pricing.\n\nChanges:\n1. Added ec2_savings_plans field to pricing catalog type definition\n2. Added EC2 Instance SP pricing data for t3.large, t3.xlarge, t3.2xlarge:\n   - 1-year: ~40% discount (e.g., t3.large: $0.0653/hr = $47.67/mo)\n   - 3-year: ~60% discount (e.g., t3.large: $0.0435/hr = $31.75/mo)\n3. Updated simulator to use ec2_savings_plans data for EC2-SavingsPlan option\n4. Updated DiscountRateInfo to show accurate EC2 Instance SP pricing\n\nPricing Examples (EC2 t3.large, 730 hrs/mo):\n- On-Demand: $79.42/mo\n- EC2-SP 1yr: $47.67/mo (40.0% discount)\n- EC2-SP 3yr: $31.75/mo (60.0% discount)\n- Compute-SP 1yr: $63.54/mo (20.0% discount)\n- Compute-SP 3yr: $47.65/mo (40.0% discount)\n\nBenefits:\n- More accurate cost estimation using Tokyo region data\n- Instance family-specific discount rates\n- Better comparison between Compute SP and EC2 Instance SP","tree":{"sha":"be2b4134a1f69a73e46820c95d80adb2613b6fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/be2b4134a1f69a73e46820c95d80adb2613b6fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/446c6922f585a25a75fe0058d2e92d8efe30efab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/446c6922f585a25a75fe0058d2e92d8efe30efab","node_id":"C_kwDOQdRS5NoAKDQ0NmM2OTIyZjU4NWEyNWE3NWZlMDA1OGQyZTkyZDhlZmUzMGVmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/aec40f2749dde01f2bd117d1e2eafd38b336d48f","sha":"aec40f2749dde01f2bd117d1e2eafd38b336d48f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/aec40f2749dde01f2bd11