":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/aec40f2749dde01f2bd117d1e2eafd38b336d48f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T11:47:14Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T11:47:14Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"feat: Add EC2 Savings Plans option to standard RI/SP selection\n\nAdd EC2-SavingsPlan option alongside Compute Savings Plan. When EC2-SavingsPlan is selected:\n- EC2 resources use the selected term''s Savings Plan pricing (same as Compute SP)\n- Non-EC2 resources (RDS, ElastiCache, etc.) automatically use RI 3-year NoUpfront pricing\n\nThis allows more accurate cost estimation when using EC2-specific Savings Plans\nwith mixed resource types.\n\nChanges:\n- components/SimulationConfig.tsx: Add EC2-SavingsPlan option to dropdown\n- lib/simulator.ts: Implement EC2-SavingsPlan logic with RI 3yr NoUpfront fallback for non-EC2\n- components/ui/DiscountRateInfo.tsx: Add EC2-SP documentation section\n\nBenefits:\n- More realistic pricing for EC2-focused Savings Plans\n- Automatic fallback to RI pricing for unsupported services\n- Clear documentation of service support differences","tree":{"sha":"681fac74d9944b6f9e0ecd58f3b2028a0475be02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/681fac74d9944b6f9e0ecd58f3b2028a0475be02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/aec40f2749dde01f2bd117d1e2eafd38b336d48f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us