","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/8d63f66fdb49e9c2a4d0f29df19f693c64d92266/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:19:28Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:19:28Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"docs: Update discount rate info with service-specific Savings Plan support\n\nUpdate DiscountRateInfo modal to clarify Savings Plan availability by service:\n\nChanges to Standard RI/SP Section:\n- Old note: ''SPは、ComputeSavingsPlansから簡易的に算定''\n- New note: ''SPはEC2のみ適用可能。RDS、ElastiCache等はRIのみ対応''\n- Added warning in SP features: ''EC2専用：RDS、ElastiCache等ではRIに自動フォールバック''\n\nUpdated Usage Guidelines:\n- Option 2: Added ''※EC2のみ'' to SP 3年 (40.0%)\n- Clarifies that SP is EC2-only option\n\nNew Section: Service Support Table\n- Comprehensive table showing SP/RI support by service\n- Services covered: EC2, RDS, ElastiCache, OpenSearch, Redshift, DynamoDB\n- Clear indication of what happens in simulator when SP is selected\n- Visual indicators: ✅ (supported), ❌ (not supported), ⚠️ (special case)\n\nService Support Details:\n┌─────────────┬────────────┬─────────────┬──────────────────────┐\n│ Service     │ SP Support │ RI Support  │ Simulator Behavior   │\n├─────────────┼────────────┼─────────────┼──────────────────────┤\n│ EC2         │ ✅         │ ✅          │ Uses SP when selected│\n│ RDS         │ ❌         │ ✅          │ Auto-fallback to RI  │\n│ ElastiCache │ ❌         │ ✅          │ Auto-fallback to RI  │\n│ OpenSearch  │ ❌         │ ✅          │ Auto-fallback to RI  │\n│ Redshift    │ ❌         │ ✅          │ Auto-fallback to RI  │\n│ DynamoDB    │ ❌         │ ⚠️ RC      │ Reserved Capacity    │\n└─────────────┴────────────┴─────────────┴──────────────────────┘\n\nImportant Warning Added:\n''複数サービスを混在させてSPを選択すると、EC2以外は自動的にRI NoUpfrontで計算されます''\n\nThis documentation update:\n- Prevents user confusion about SP availability\n- Explains automatic fallback behavior\n- Aligns with actual AWS service offerings\n- Matches the pricing fix in commit 388091f","tree":{"sha":"9abc1a4a26bd05be7526fa991045a687c7395b06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/9abc1a4a26bd05be7526fa991045a687c7395b06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/8d63f66fdb49e9c2a4d0f29df19f693c64d92266","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/8d63f66fdb49e9c2a4d0f29df19f693c64d92266","node_id":"C_kwDOQdRS5NoAKDhkNjNmNjZmZGI0OWU5YzJhNGQwZjI5ZGYxOWY2OTNjNjRkOTIyNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/388091f969be40525559ee01261d5e10a13a2891","sha":"388091f969be40525559ee01261d5e10a13a2891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/388091f969be40525559ee01261d5e10a13a2891"}],"sha":"8d63f66fdb49e9c2a4d0f29df19f693c64d92266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/8d63f66fdb49e9c2a4d0f29df19f693c64d92266"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/388091f969be40525559ee01261d5e10a13a2891/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:45:59Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:45:59Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"fix: Remove incorrect Savings Plan pricing from RDS instances\n\nCRITICAL FIX: RDS Savings Plan pricing was causing negative cost savings\n\nProblem:\n- RDS db.t4g.large had Savings Plan pricing defined\n- The pricing was incorrectly copied from EC2 t3.2xlarge\n- SP 1yr: $0.34816/hr (should not exist for RDS)\n- SP 3yr: $0.26112/hr (should not exist for RDS)\n\nImpact:\n- RDS on-demand: $0.202/hr × 730 = $147.46/month\n- Incorrect SP 1yr: $0.34816/hr × 730 = $254.16/month\n- Savings: $147.46 - $254.16 = -$106.70 (NEGATIVE!)\n\nRoot Cause:\n- EC2 t3.2xlarge on-demand: $0.4352/hr\n- 20% discount: $0.4352 × 0.80 = $0.34816/hr (EC2 pricing)\n- This was mistakenly copied to RDS db.t4g.large\n\nReality:\n- AWS does NOT offer Savings Plans for RDS\n- Only Reserved Instances are available for RDS\n- Simulator has correct fallback: SP not found → use RI NoUpfront\n\nSolution:\n- Remove savings_plans block from db.t4g.large\n- Simulator will now correctly fallback to RI NoUpfront\n- RDS 1yr RI NoUpfront: $0.1572/hr × 730 = $114.76/month\n- Correct savings: $147.46 - $114.76 = $32.70 (POSITIVE!)\n\nAWS Service Support:\n- EC2: ✅ Savings Plans supported\n- RDS: ❌ Savings Plans NOT supported (RI only)\n- ElastiCache: ❌ RI only\n- OpenSearch: ❌ RI only\n- Redshift: ❌ RI only\n- DynamoDB: Reserved Capacity only\n\nThis fix ensures accurate cost calculations when mixing RDS with Savings Plan option.","tree":{"sha":"8899f50b3b9a07235b35efbbda828c337b3cba0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/8899f50b3b9a07235b35efbbda828c337b3cba0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/388091f969be40525559ee01261d5e10a13a2891","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravata