rl":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/53898e6d49f987f9e4eb8b40ed5dd9a2825e3830/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-19T07:19:39Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T07:19:39Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"fix: Update refund policy text to clarify savings loss refund\n\nUpdate insurance commitment feature description in customer cost comparison:\n\nChanged:\n- Old: ''使用量に応じて返金あり'' (Refund based on usage)\n- New: ''Savingsの損失に応じて返金あり'' (Refund based on savings loss)\n\nReason:\n- More accurately reflects the actual refund calculation logic\n- Refunds occur when insurance commitment cost exceeds on-demand covered cost\n- Formula: if (savingsAmount < 0) then expectedRefund = -savingsAmount\n- This happens when coverage is low, not directly based on usage amount\n\nThe new wording better aligns with:\n- The technical implementation in lib/simulator.ts\n- The refund calculation based on savings loss\n- User understanding of when refunds are triggered\n\nThis provides customers with more accurate information about the refund policy.","tree":{"sha":"b421727358598762f9f36ba64f5e589b3c302658","url":"https://api.githu