Commitment card (unchanged)\n- FileTextIcon: Standard RI/SP card (unchanged)\n- CoinsIcon: Refund and benefits display (unchanged)\n\nThis fixes the customer mode rendering error and allows the cost comparison section to display correctly.","tree":{"sha":"785a21ca38166388d3bd9e1319a6998264ff2b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/785a21ca38166388d3bd9e1319a6998264ff2b9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/d0dae6c8defcbfab150349126d9fd95202bd3980","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/d0dae6c8defcbfab150349126d9fd95202bd3980","node_id":"C_kwDOQdRS5NoAKGQwZGFlNmM4ZGVmY2JmYWIxNTAzNDkxMjZkOWZkOTUyMDJiZDM5ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/bf74e1a46af22126ef39ff2d650656d303bbe467","sha":"bf74e1a46af22126ef39ff2d650656d303bbe467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/bf74e1a46af22126ef39ff2d650656d303bbe467"}],"sha":"d0dae6c8defcbfab150349126d9fd95202bd3980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/d0dae6c8defcbfab150349126d9fd95202bd3980"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/bf74e1a46af22126ef39ff2d650656d303bbe467/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-19T07:03:45Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T07:03:45Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"feat: Add customer cost comparison section for customer mode\n\nAdd dedicated cost comparison view for customer mode that highlights:\n\nCustomer Cost Comparison Features:\n- Display effective cost including refunds\n- Side-by-side comparison of all three options (On-Demand, Insurance, Standard RI/SP)\n- Visual emphasis on Insurance Commitment benefits\n- Cost reduction percentages for easy understanding\n- Highlighted ''recommended'' badge on Insurance Commitment\n- Comparison summary showing advantages over Standard RI/SP\n\nDisplay Components:\n1. Three-column layout:\n   - On-Demand baseline (reference)\n   - Insurance Commitment (highlighted with ''おすすめ'' badge)\n   - Standard RI/SP\n\n2. Insurance Commitment card shows:\n   - Monthly cost\n   - Expected refund (if applicable)\n   - Effective cost (cost - refund)\n   - Total cost reduction with percentage\n   - Green highlighted savings box\n\n3. Standard RI/SP card shows:\n   - Monthly cost\n   - Initial cost (if applicable, with warning color)\n   - Cost reduction with percentage\n\n4. Comparison summary section:\n   - Cost difference vs Standard RI/SP\n   - Initial cost savings\n   - Key benefits list (zero upfront, refund policy, flexible terms, high savings)\n\nCustomer-Friendly Language:\n- All terminology uses ''コスト削減'' (cost reduction)\n- Clear visual hierarchy with colors\n- Simple percentage displays\n- Prominent refund information\n- Benefits-focused messaging\n\nFiles changed:\n- components/ui/CustomerCostComparison.tsx: New customer-specific comparison component\n- components/SimulationResults.tsx: Conditionally render CustomerCostComparison in customer mode\n\nThis provides customers with a clear, benefit-focused view of cost optimization options.","tree":{"sha":"4a121232c03d830ae857f75de6b62e9d19ddfaef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/4a121232c03d830ae857f75de6b62e9d19ddfaef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/bf74e1a46af22126ef39ff2d650656d303bbe467","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{