276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/eb056c6b8c3a9007f1b069780b6e03195dba9650/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-19T05:34:24Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T05:34:24Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"feat: Add MSP mode and customer mode with URL parameter toggle\n\nImplement dual-mode display system using URL parameter (?mode=customer):\n\nMSP Mode (default):\n- Full display with all MSP-related terminology\n- Revenue highlights and forecast reports visible\n- Premium and revenue calculations shown\n- P&L terminology (損益分岐, 削減額, etc.)\n\nCustomer Mode (?mode=customer):\n- MSP terminology hidden\n- Revenue highlights and forecast reports hidden\n- Premium column hidden in details table\n- Cost optimization terminology (コスト回収期間, コスト削減)\n- Simplified display focused on cost savings\n\nImplementation details:\n- Add isMSPMode prop to all result components\n- Use useSearchParams() with Suspense boundary for mode detection\n- Conditional rendering for MSP-specific content\n- Mode-aware label switching throughout UI\n\nFiles changed:\n- app/page.tsx: Add mode detection and Suspense wrapper\n- components/SimulationResults.tsx: Conditional MSP content\n- components/ui/CostCards.tsx: Mode-aware labels and premium hiding\n- components/ui/DetailsTable.tsx: Conditional premium column\n- components/ui/CumulativeChart.tsx: Add isMSPMode prop\n- components/ui/MonthlyChart.tsx: Mode-aware chart labels\n\nUsage:\n- MSP mode: https://your-domain.com/\n- Customer mode: https://your-domain.com/?mode=customer","tree":{"sha":"6d3aeaf43ea1ac799c0fa89a3a1ce9375f602c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/6d3aeaf43ea1ac799c0fa89a3a1ce9375f602c87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/eb056c6b8c3a9007f1b069780b6e03195dba9650","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/eb056c6b8c3a9007f1b069780b6e03195dba9650","node_id":"C_kwDOQdRS5NoAKGViMDU2YzZiOGMzYTkwMDdmMWIwNjk3ODBiNmUwMzE5NWRiYTk2NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/3a86344737e0cc760d769ae338601d3d96b2af45","sha