s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/3a86344737e0cc760d769ae338601d3d96b2af45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:33:21Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:33:21Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"fix: Update insurance commitment discount rate from 60% to 40%\n\n- Update SimulationConfig.tsx insurance plan options:\n  - 30-day plan: 60%割引 → 40%割引\n  - 1-year plan: 60%割引 → 40%割引\n- Update lib/pricing-catalog.ts insurance_plans:\n  - 30d discount_rate: 0.60 → 0.40\n  - 1y discount_rate: 0.60 → 0.40\n- Premium rates remain unchanged (50% and 33%)\n\nThis aligns with the new calculation logic:\n- EC2: ComputeSP 3yr equivalent (40% discount)\n- Base cost = on-demand × 0.60 (40% off)\n- The discount_rate field represents the base discount before premium\n\nImpact:\n- Corrects display in simulation configuration dropdown\n- Ensures consistency across UI and pricing catalog\n- Aligns with updated DiscountRateInfo modal","tree":{"sha":"c12cd687ae470ad9320045baac6e7f775d1f5593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/c12cd687ae470ad9320045baac6e7f775d1f5593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/3a86344737e0cc760d769ae338601d3d96b2af45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co