received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/81cb98020617d624fd9b27a2743ead5033ed3208/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:27:42Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:27:42Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"docs: Update discount rate info to match new calculation logic\n\nUpdate DiscountRateInfo modal to reflect latest pricing changes:\n\nInsurance Commitment Updates:\n- Note: EC2 uses ComputeSP 3yr equivalent (40% discount), other services use 3yr RI/SP\n- Discount rate: 60% → 40% (base discount before premium)\n- 30-day plan:\n  - Effective discount: 30.0% → 20.0%\n  - Monthly cost: $55.60 → $63.53\n- 1-year plan:\n  - Effective discount: 40.2% → 26.8%\n  - Monthly cost: $47.50 → $58.13\n- Feature note: Changed from ''未使用分は返金'' to ''Savingsの損失分は返金''\n- Feature note: Added ''EC2はComputeSP 3年相当（40%割引）を基準に算定''\n\nSavings Plans Updates:\n- 1-year SP:\n  - Discount: 40.0% → 20.0%\n  - Monthly cost: $47.67 → $63.54\n- 3-year SP:\n  - Discount: 60.0% → 40.0%\n  - Monthly cost: $31.75 → $47.65\n\nUsage Guidance Updates:\n- Option 2: Updated from ''SP 1年 (40.0%)'' to ''RI 3年 NoUpfront (56.8%) または SP 3年 (40.0%)''\n- Option 3: Updated effective discount from 40.2% to 26.8%\n- Option 4: Updated effective discount from 30.0% to 20.0%\n\nAll calculations based on EC2 t3.large (on-demand $0.1088/hr, 730 hrs/month = $79.42/month)","tree":{"sha":"6d92c11ccd7ac3e91bea831e69bb5b4ca4b6ac49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/6d92c11ccd7ac3e