,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commits/d6230943ed72cb6de787b50f6c0cd9fa7b12011d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:24:10Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T14:24:10Z","email":"genspark_dev@genspark.ai","name":"hkdstamp"},"message":"fix: Correct non-EC2 insurance commitment fallback to 0.60 multiplier\n\n- Update final fallback for non-EC2 services from on-demand × 0.40 to on-demand × 0.60\n- This ensures consistency: all services use 40% discount (multiply by 0.60) when no RI/SP pricing is available\n- Aligns with EC2 calculation: on-demand × 0.60 = 40% discount\n- Fallback chain for non-EC2:\n  1. 3yr NoUpfront RI (preferred)\n  2. 3yr Savings Plan\n  3. on-demand × 0.60 (40% discount, was incorrectly 0.40)\n\nImpact:\n- Fixes pricing consistency across all services\n- Non-EC2 services without RI/SP data now correctly use 40% discount","tree":{"sha":"e595af29bfa50187eca75b77f2caf0d72