 rates\n- When coverage < 100%, unused portion results in negative savings → refund\n- Formula: insuranceCoveredCost = baseline3yrNoUpfront (no coverage multiplication)\n- Update documentation to clarify fixed pricing model\n- This aligns with actual insurance commitment product behavior","tree":{"sha":"cadc67f045540693985eb16236cf6568a5b5bb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/trees/cadc67f045540693985eb16236cf6568a5b5bb3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkdstamp/compare-risp/git/commits/d81307c7a2124f524485ce9b97b1577a09db180d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276256202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/msc-vending-survey","id":276256202,"login":"msc-vending-survey","node_id":"U_kgDOEHdVyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msc-vending-survey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/d81307c7a2124f524485ce9b97b1577a09db180d","node_id":"C_kwDOQdRS5NoAKGQ4MTMwN2M3YTIxMjRmNTI0NDg1Y2U5Yjk3YjE1NzdhMDlkYjE4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hkdstamp/compare-risp/commit/8c6b23a3