","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians","id":38564313,"login":"murdskristians","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTY0MzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commits/6d47705f1ff4dea635d388c62a3b732fbdf1eef3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:32:03Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T20:32:03Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"message":"Standardize dev server startup on `pnpm dev`\n\nEvery front-end project in the folder now starts the same way. The\noriginal script (start/serve) is kept so deploy configs and tooling\nthat reference it keep working.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8f83267005a7aec75aeb5bededf9e690c125dd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/git/trees/e8f83267005a7aec75aeb5bededf9e690c125dd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/git/commits/6d47705f1ff4dea635d388c62a3b732fbdf1eef3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians","id":38564313,"login":"murdskristians","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTY0MzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commit/6d47705f1ff4dea635d388c62a3b732fbdf1eef3","node_id":"C_kwDOQdg__9oAKDZkNDc3MDVmMWZmNGRlYTYzNWQzODhjNjJhM2I3MzJmYmRmMWVlZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commit/54f2cae8e450d2a9234e78e31e22185e204a2222","sha":"54f2cae8e450d2a9234e78e31e22185e204a2222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commits/54f2cae8e450d2a9234e78e31e22185e204a2222"}],"sha":"6d47705f1ff4dea635d388c62a3b732fbdf1eef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commits/6d47705f1ff4dea635d388c62a3b732fbdf1eef3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians","id":38564313,"login":"murdskristians","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTY0MzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/commits/54f2cae8e450d2a9234e78e31e22185e204a2222/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:41:34Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T22:41:34Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"message":"Fix mobile layout and make Firebase failures visible\n\nMobile layout was unusable: the sidebar covered the grid and sat a\nheader''s height too low, and the header overflowed its row.\n\n- Sidebar becomes a real off-canvas drawer on phones: slides on\n  transform, sits flush under the header, has a tap-to-dismiss scrim,\n  and starts closed. The old rule set `top: 64px` inside .calendar-body,\n  which already begins below the header, so the offset applied twice.\n- Header fits one row: drop the logo and the unwired search/settings\n  buttons, shorten the month label, tighten spacing. The old rule hid\n  `.view-selector`, a class the header never rendered.\n- Default to Day view on phones; a 7-column week grid is unreadable at\n  360px. Week stays selectable.\n- Narrow the Schedule-X hour gutter from 75px to 44px on mobile and cut\n  the day height, giving the day column 344px instead of 313px.\n- Event modal becomes a bottom sheet with stacked date fields and 16px\n  inputs, which stops iOS Safari zooming on focus.\n- Correct Schedule-X selectors to the `sx__` prefix. `.sx-event`,\n  `.sx-time-grid-day__time-axis` and `.sx-current-time-indicator`\n  matched nothing, so that styling had never applied.\n- Add `min-width: 0` to .calendar-main and use 100dvh.\n\nFirebase config is now validated before use, so a missing or invalid\nconfig renders an error screen naming the missing variables instead of\nthrowing during module import and leaving a blank page. Anonymous\nsign-in failure no longer leaves a permanent silent spinner: it reports\nthe error with a retry, and a 15s watchdog covers a wedged network.\n\nAlso add the calendar composite indexes, replace the world-readable\nfirestore.rules with owner-scoped rules (not deployed - deploy.sh is\nhosting-only, and this Firebase project is shared with the chatbot app),\nand declare areDatesInSameWeek before the callback that lists it as a\ndependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"606496640a57072b6029f0b445d29fb607c1c6e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/git/trees/606496640a57072b6029f0b445d29fb607c1c6e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/React-Calendar-module-federation/git/commits/54f2cae8e450d2a9234e78e31e22185e204a2222","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians","id":38564313,"login":"murdskristians","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTY0MzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/received_events","repos_url":"http