ew_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/c46a891b6f375b04f01cee2e04ad023f53cfad1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:32:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:32:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add Cloudflare Kumo design system app\n\nAdd apps/kumo with all 20 canonical forms built on @cloudflare/kumo\n(Base UI primitives + Tailwind v4 tokens), running on React 18.\n\n- Uses Kumo''s prebuilt standalone stylesheet, so no Tailwind build step\n- Light/dark via Kumo''s data-mode attribute on <html>\n- Labels, options, validation and button text match react-no-css\n- Registered in the shell config and the build list\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ept9AMzwmUVMF9Lw3eJMfy","tree":{"sha":"e4dfbd0202d4d9a8c8e01312e910602a03eaac69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/trees/e4dfbd0202d4d9a8c8e01312e910602a03eaac69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/commits/c46a891b6f375b04f01cee2e04ad023f53cfad1a","verification":{"payload":"tree e4dfbd0202d4d9a8c8e01312e910602a03eaac69\nparent c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791005558 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791005558 +0000\n\nfeat: add Cloudflare Kumo design system app\n\nAdd apps/kumo with all 20 canonical forms built on @cloudflare/kumo\n(Base UI primitives + Tailwind v4 tokens), running on React 18.\n\n- Uses Kumo''s prebuilt standalone stylesheet, so no Tailwind build step\n- Light/dark via Kumo''s data-mode attribute on <html>\n- Labels, options, validation and button text match react-no-css\n- Registered in the shell config and the build list\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ept9AMzwmUVMF9Lw3eJMfy\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFS9CxuG\nzGLyGsOacsX3enhIAwpKhmcir9qGisQQ56wrOiTBqG9kmkgsW0y3O6BXOwT2IxNRJllYcLmmwH5O\nBg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T05:32:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commit/c46a891b6f375b04f01cee2e04ad023f53cfad1a","node_id":"C_kwDOQdv_ZdoAKGM0NmE4OTFiNmYzNzViMDRmMDFjZWUyZTA0YWQwMjNmNTNjZmFkMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commit/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a","sha":"c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a"}],"sha":"c46a891b6f375b04f01cee2e04ad023f53cfad1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/c46a891b6f375b04f01cee2e04ad023f53cfad1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:23:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:23:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(deps): refresh lockfile, drop stale lockfiles, migrate Base UI\n\nRe-resolve bun.lock within the existing version ranges. This clears\n94 of 97 advisories reported by `bun audit`, including both criticals\n(piscina, shell-quote). React apps stay on their current majors: the\n42 React 18 apps still resolve react 18.3.1.\n\n- Delete package-lock.json and pnpm-lock.yaml. Bun is the only package\n  manager in use; both files were out of date. Dependabot now uses the\n  \"bun\" ecosystem so it keeps bun.lock updated.\n- Bump sharp to ^0.35.5 (libvips/libheif advisories).\n- Remove the @cloudscape-design/component-toolkit override. It pinned\n  beta.156, which lacks exports that @cloudscape-design/components\n  3.0.1391 needs, so the Cloudscape build failed.\n- Base UI: @base-ui-components/react was renamed to @base-ui/react;\n  move from 1.0.0-rc.0 to ^1.8.0.\n- Material Tailwind: dedupe react/react-dom in Vite. The library lists\n  react 18.2.0 as a hard dependency, and the fresh resolve bundled it\n  next to the app''s React, crashing every form on load.\n\nVerified with a full build (47/47 apps), the shell Playwright suite\n(32/32, chromium), and a browser smoke test of all 46 libraries x 20\nforms x 2 themes compared against the pre-update build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ept9AMzwmUVMF9Lw3eJMfy","tree":{"sha":"6a516e144f497f4b364c669ce44223c277cd49cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/trees/6a516e144f497f4b364c669ce44223c277cd49cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/commits/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a516e144f497f4b364c669ce44223c277cd49cf\nparent 224390b5738041285c5f019b469ada4a6c49a7c5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791005017 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791005017 +0000\n\nchore(deps): refresh lockfile, drop stale lockfiles, migrate Base UI\n\nRe-resolve bun.lock within the existing version ranges. This clears\n94 of 97 advisories reported by `bun audit`, including both criticals\n(piscina, shell-quote). React apps stay on their current majors: the\n42 React 18 apps still resolve react 18.3.1.\n\n- Delete package-lock.json and pnpm-lock.yaml. Bun is the only package\n  manager in use; both files were out of date. Dependabot now uses the\n  \"bun\" ecosystem so it keeps bun.lock updated.\n- Bump sharp to ^0.35.5 (libvips/libheif advisories).\n- Remove the @cloudscape-design/component-toolkit override. It pinned\n  beta.156, which lacks exports that @cloudscape-design/components\n  3.0.1391 needs, so the Cloudscape build failed.\n- Base UI: @base-ui-components/react was renamed to @base-ui/react;\n  move from 1.0.0-rc.0 to ^1.8.0.\n- Material Tailwind: dedupe react/react-dom in Vite. The library lists\n  react 18.2.0 as a hard dependency, and the fresh resolve bundled it\n  next to the app''s React, crashing every form on load.\n\nVerified with a full build (47/47 apps), the shell Playwright suite\n(32/32, chromium), and a browser smoke test of all 46 libraries x 20\nforms x 2 themes compared against the pre-update build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ept9AMzwmUVMF9Lw3eJMfy\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBLoe/Tm\nAwmw+ZGrzae7Z2dyTgfIOM2db1L3wILnShK0rlg+bFNmWOUvR4NBrR3H3PebPWsOKV2yp19oMDJr\n+ws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T05:23:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commit/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a","node_id":"C_kwDOQdv_ZdoAKGM0ZDBjZTA5ZDhiNTc4ZTRlZDZmZDBkYzMwOTViYjhkYzRkZjZiMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commit/224390b5738041285c5f019b469ada4a6c49a7c5","sha":"224390b5738041285c5f019b469ada4a6c49a7c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/224390b5738041285c5f019b469ada4a6c49a7c5"}],"sha":"c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/c4d0ce09d8b578e4ed6fd0dc3095bb8dc4df6b1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/commits/72eb5e9ce9627c604b9671aa147bcdc409390efe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:12:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:12:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: fail build-all when any library app fails to build\n\nbuild-all.mjs only exited non-zero when the shell failed. A broken\nlibrary app was listed under \"Failed builds\" but the script still printed\n\"All done\" and exited 0, so the deploy workflow published a site whose\niframes for that library returned 404. main().catch(console.error) also\nswallowed unexpected errors with exit code 0.\n\nNow, after copying builds to dist/ (kept so local previews still work),\nthe script exits 1 if any app failed, and unexpected errors exit 1 too.\n--allow-failures (or BUILD_ALLOW_FAILURES=1) restores the lenient\nbehaviour for local use; documented in the README Scripts table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NJzaHCcfWDaJDw3iBwWnne","tree":{"sha":"60ed991259e726f5aa4a28690ccb0fd3cbb77c6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/trees/60ed991259e726f5aa4a28690ccb0fd3cbb77c6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/commits/72eb5e9ce9627c604b9671aa147bcdc409390efe","verification":{"payload":"tree 60ed991259e726f5aa4a28690ccb0fd3cbb77c6e\nparent bc34aba76a4cabe9bfe545bc8dccf3689808e482\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790961157 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790961157 +0000\n\nfix: fail build-all when any library app fails to build\n\nbuild-all.mjs only exited non-zero when the shell failed. A broken\nlibrary app was listed under \"Failed builds\" but the script still printed\n\"All done\" and exited 0, so the deploy workflow published a site whose\niframes for that library returned 404. main().catch(console.error) also\nswallowed unexpected errors with exit code 0.\n\nNow, after copying builds to dist/ (kept so local previews still work),\nthe script exits 1 if any app failed, and unexpected errors exit 1 too.\n--allow-failures (or BUILD_ALLOW_FAILURES=1) restores the lenient\nbehaviour for local use; documented in the README Scripts table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NJzaHCcfWDaJDw3iBwWnne\n","reason":"valid","si