7:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep React at 18.3.1 for compatibility\n\nMany design system libraries (atlaskit, blueprint, elastic-ui, polaris,\nmaterial-tailwind, evergreen, semantic-ui, zendesk-garden) explicitly cap\ntheir React peer dependency at 18 and haven''t been tested against React 19.\n\nHaving React 19 as the workspace version while libraries declare React 18\npeer deps risks multiple React versions being installed, causing hook\nerrors and other runtime issues.\n\nRevert react, react-dom, @types/react, and @types/react-dom back to their\nReact 18 ranges. All other library updates remain.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01J4682LBnVg4HJ3PZLse8oo","tree":{"sha":"0ab361ecccbf5735050e803d0cdf900a8d3fe65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/trees/0ab361ecccbf5735050e803d0cdf900a8d3fe65a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/evgenyvinnik/20forms-20designs/git/commits/879b1402eeb2d848cf73f6ae8f58e780b96a233b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ab361ecccbf5735050e803d0cdf900a8d3fe65a\nparent 4a5863076222f111fa7902a06571e0a8f9908704\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775966847 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775966847 +0000\n\nKeep React at 18.3.1 for compatibility\n\nMany design system libraries (atlaskit, blueprint, elastic-ui, polaris,\nmaterial-tailwind, evergreen, semantic-ui, zendesk-garden) explicitly cap\ntheir React peer dependency at 18 and haven''t been tested against React 19.\n\nHaving React 19 as the workspace version while libraries declare React 18\npeer deps risks multiple React versions being installed, causing hook\nerrors and other runtime issues.\n\nRevert react, react-dom, @types/react, and @types/react-dom back to their\nReact 18 ranges. All other library updates remain.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01J4682LBnVg4HJ3PZLse8oo\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by