 Bamgbose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T22:47:33Z","email":"timileyinbamgbose@Timileyins-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Timileyin Bamgbose"},"message":"fix: resolve all test failures and apply senior engineer standards\n\nAssessment Requirements Completed:\n- Fix all failing tests (54/54 now passing)\n- Resolve data loading issues (initial + real-time)\n- Stabilize architecture (Zustand, TanStack Query, WebSocket fallback)\n- Ensure all features work as expected\n- Clean, readable, typed TypeScript code\n- Updated README with architecture and improvements\n\nSenior Engineer Fixes Applied:\n\nHIGH PRIORITY:\n- WebSocket memory leak prevention (isMounted ref, proper cleanup)\n- AbortController integration in all fetch operations\n- Race condition prevention in WebSocket callbacks\n- No state mutation in data transformation pipelines\n- API input sanitization and validation (symbol whitelist, regex)\n- Secure UUID generation with crypto.randomUUID()\n\nMEDIUM PRIORITY:\n- Fixed setState in useMemo anti-pattern (PriceChart.tsx)\n- Moved tooltip components outside render functions\n- Replaced all `any` types with proper TypeScript interfaces\n- Added ARIA labels and accessibility attributes\n- Proper memoization with memo(), useMemo, useCallback\n- Request timeouts (10-15 seconds) on all API calls\n\nCode Quality:\n- ESLint: 0 errors, 0 warnings (was 15 errors, 8 warnings)\n- TypeScript: Strict mode, zero type errors\n- Tests: 54/54 passing","tree":{"sha":"8db925f4989fc329fee0a81f6f7c672eed39b82e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Timmy009/assessment/git/trees/8db925f4989fc329fee0a81f6f7c672eed39b82e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Timmy009/assessment/git/commits/98ad61aa1d535c30a43fe1b9ee0841ffc910f724","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Timmy009/assessment/commit/98ad61aa1d535c30a43fe1b9ee0841ffc910f724","node_id":"C_kwDOQdwBX