OSTS-50-STEP-PROCESS.md)\n- Removed mount function wrappers from Products/Contact remotes (not needed for WC integration)\n- Improved React web components to prevent remounting on theme changes","tree":{"sha":"ace3ebac05a00915d483ee8f98a2817f535f4a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/trees/ace3ebac05a00915d483ee8f98a2817f535f4a13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/commits/495b424243933b3b71999201d69b4ad7ae9a4ee6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/495b424243933b3b71999201d69b4ad7ae9a4ee6","node_id":"C_kwDOQdwLftoAKDQ5NWI0MjQyNDM5MzNiM2I3MTk5OTIwMWQ2OWI0YWQ3YWU5YTRlZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5","sha":"fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5"}],"sha":"495b424243933b3b71999201d69b4ad7ae9a4ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/495b424243933b3b71999201d69b4ad7ae9a4ee6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:48:11Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:48:11Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"message":"refactor: Rename scripts with framework-specific naming convention\n\nMF scripts:\n- mf-start-preview.ps1 -> mf-start-react-preview.ps1\n- mf-start-quick.ps1 -> mf-start-react-quick.ps1\n- mf-start-watch.ps1 -> mf-start-react-watch.ps1\n- Add mf-start-angular-quick.ps1\n\nWC scripts:\n- wc-start.ps1 -> wc-start-react.ps1\n- wc-start-quick.ps1 -> wc-start-react-quick.ps1\n- Add wc-start-angular-quick.ps1\n\nPattern: {context}-{action}-{framework}[-mode].ps1","tree":{"sha":"de4163def2577b74e53a432d8933ff6cf02b7d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/trees/de4163def2577b74e53a432d8933ff6cf02b7d61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/commits/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5","node_id":"C_kwDOQdwLftoAKGZlMzk5NmY2Y2M2ZDc4NDA0YTZhNzI4Mzk1ZTQwMGY1MWZjZTAxZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc","sha":"a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc"}],"sha":"fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/fe3996f6cc6d78404a6a728395e400f51fce01d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:34:50Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:34:50Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"message":"refactor: Restructure hosts and scripts for MF/WC separation\n\nHosts:\n- Rename host -> host-react-mf (React Module Federation host, port 5000)\n- Rename host-webcomponent -> host-react-wc (React Web Component host, port 5010)\n- Add host-angular-mf (Angular Module Federation host scaffold, port 5007)\n- Add host-angular-wc (Angular Web Component host scaffold, port 5011)\n\nScripts reorganization:\n- Create scripts/MF/ for Module Federation scripts\n- Create scripts/WC/ for Web Component scripts\n- Create scripts/utils/ for utility scripts\n- Add mf-start-angular.ps1 for Angular MF host\n- Add wc-start-angular.ps1 for Angular WC host\n- Update wc-copy-widgets.ps1 to copy to both React and Angular WC hosts\n- Update utils-install-all.ps1 to include all 4 hosts\n\nAll script path references updated for new folder structure","tree":{"sha":"ec0cd5aaed893fa97186415bda8216626a9a1ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/trees/ec0cd5aaed893fa97186415bda8216626a9a1ecf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/commits/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc","node_id":"C_kwDOQdwLftoAKGE4ZjRkYjNhYTMyOGMxZTU1MDAyYjA4NGIyZGY5OTc4ZGFlOTE0ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/bb83c950cb1525f5dd8da9a2f5afc7c108c204a1","sha":"bb83c950cb1525f5dd8da9a2f5afc7c108c204a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/bb83c950cb1525f5dd8da9a2f5afc7c108c204a1"}],"sha":"a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/a8f4db3aa328c1e55002b084b2df9978dae914dc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/bb83c950cb1525f5dd8da9a2f5afc7c108c204a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:00:21Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T19:00:21Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@example.com","name":"Praveen Cherukuri"},"message"