Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@gmail.com","name":"praveen cherukuri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:17:07Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@gmail.com","name":"praveen cherukuri"},"message":"Fix: Simplify web component utilities - remove overengineered wrapper\n\n**Problems with previous approach:**\n- Used JSX in .ts files (should be .tsx) causing syntax errors\n- Overengineered base class abstraction\n- Too complex for simple utility functions\n\n**New simplified approach:**\n- Simple utility functions instead of base class\n- No JSX in utils/ folder (pure TypeScript)\n- Each webcomponent.tsx handles its own rendering\n- Utilities provide:\n  * getThemeMode() - theme validation\n  * safeParseInt() - safe number parsing\n  * unmountReactRoot() - safe cleanup\n  * registerWebComponent() - safe registration\n\n**Result:**\n- Zero linting errors âœ…\n- Cleaner, more maintainable code\n- Easier to understand\n- No overabstraction","tree":{"sha":"719d82c124ec6795d16fd8ee8b9ec15bcd9ff7eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/trees/719d82c124ec6795d16fd8ee8b9ec15bcd9ff7eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/commits/c5e72f2625f39f64fc7611232800b2dfaa725e17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38438383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79","id":38438383,"login":"praveencherukuri79","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM4Mzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/orgs","receiv