erukuri79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commits/6eecd2ea10db75820c64b55c8e6f629a47d1e224/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:09:41Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@gmail.com","name":"praveen cherukuri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T23:09:41Z","email":"praveencherukuri79@gmail.com","name":"praveen cherukuri"},"message":"Refactor: Add utilities, improve error handling, and reduce code duplication\n\n**New Utilities Created:**\n- utils/constants.ts - Shared constants and types\n- utils/logger.ts - Centralized logging utility\n- utils/theme.ts - Theme creation utilities\n- utils/errorHandling.ts - Error handling utilities\n- utils/webComponentBase.ts - Base class for web components\n\n**Improvements:**\n- Refactored all web components to use WebComponentBase class\n  * Reduced code from ~69 lines to ~13 lines per component\n  * Added proper error handling and error UI\n  * Consistent mount/unmount logic across all components\n\n- Enhanced stores with proper error handling:\n  * Added Zustand persist middleware for state persistence\n  * Added logging for all state changes\n  * Added MAX_CART_ITEMS validation\n  * Better type safety with constants\n\n- Improved ErrorBoundary:\n  * Added optional custom fallback prop\n  * Added optional onError callback\n  * Added ''Try Again'' reset functionality\n  * Better error details in development mode\n  * Shows component stack trace in dev\n\n- Reduced code duplication:\n  * Theme creation logic centralized\n  * Type definitions shared via constants\n  * Validation functions reusable\n  * Web component logic abstracted to base class\n\n**Runtime Exception Handling:**\n- Try-catch blocks in all web component lifecycle methods\n- Graceful error UI fallback\n- Console logging for debugging\n- Production-ready error tracking hooks\n\n**Result:**\n- ~200 lines of duplicate code eliminated\n- Better error handling throughout\n- More maintainable codebase\n- Consistent patterns across all remotes","tree":{"sha":"cd83a988f35859ccfe570daa680b74d67016be08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/trees/cd83a988f35859ccfe570daa680b74d67016be08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/git/commits/6eecd2ea10db75820c64b55c8e6f629a47d1e224","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38438383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79","id":38438383,"login":"praveencherukuri79","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM4Mzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/praveencherukuri79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/6eecd2ea10db75820c64b55c8e6f629a47d1e224","node_id":"C_kwDOQdwLftoAKDZlZWNkMmVhMTBkYjc1ODIwYzY0YjU1YzhlNmY2MjlhNDdkMWUyMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/praveencherukuri79/micro-frontend/commit/c7be73a079f4761c8fe8701d07a865a8160c65aa","sha":"c7be73a079f4761c8fe8701d07a865a8160c65a