=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/821cbccb6d48824c064f698e8f947f0026c4d856/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:33:23Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:33:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"澄清 aurora 的两种消费方式,并将 skill 分发解耦为独立 sync-skills.sh (#77)\n\n* docs(consume): 澄清消费 aurora 的两种方式 —— go get 默认,整树 vendor+改 import 仅防逆向\n\n此前文档默认把「make sync-aurora → 整棵树 vendor 进 third_party/aurora + 改 import 路径」\n当成唯一消费方式,容易误把它当通用必须。实则两条路径:\n\n- ① 默认(绝大多数项目):go get 直接依赖,不改 import、不 replace;只有 go vendor 带不走\n  的非 .go 源(前端 web / 迁移 .sql)才窄同步——只拷那几个目录进 third_party/aurora,不拷\n  Go、不改 import。⚠️ third_party/aurora 文件夹存在 ≠ 走了②,区分看有没有改 import/replace。\n- ② 身份隐藏(仅防逆向):整树 vendor + 把 import 改名到中立 host(如 bitbucket),唯一目的\n  是在交付/暴露产物里藏住上游身份(garble 的后继);没这需求一律用①。判据:import 写\n  github.com/shyandsy 还是中立 host / go.mod require 还是 replace。\n\n改动:README 新增权威节「消费 aurora:两种方式」(含判据、②的防逆向目的、skill 分发与代码\n消费正交及①怎么拿脚本);user-module-migration SKILL §7 把 skill 到达口径收窄到②。\n全程不写具体消费项目名。\n\n* feat(skills): skill 分发收口到独立 sync-skills.sh —— 与代码消费正交\n\nskill 分发原本寄生在②的「整树 vendor + post-sync 从 third_party/aurora/.claude/skills\n镜像」上,逼着只想要个 skill 的①项目去上②的整套 vendoring —— 这正是「把②当默认」的误导源。\n拆开,让拿 skill 和怎么消费 aurora 代码彻底无关:\n\n- 新增 scripts/sync-skills.sh:把 aurora 的 .claude/skills 同步进消费项目根 .claude/skills/,\n  不碰 go.mod/third_party。两种取源自动择一——A 本地有 third_party/aurora 树(②)则零网络\n  镜像;B 否则从上游只 sparse-checkout .claude/skills @REF(①正路),不下 Go/web 源、不建\n  third_party。支持 SKILLS=\"a b\" 只同步部分。\n- ① 项目怎么拿到本脚本:它是零依赖单文件,拷一份进自己仓 scripts/ 即可(这不是 vendor\n  aurora),堵掉「为拿脚本回头 clone/vendor 整个 aurora」的坑。\n- scripts/post-sync.sh 收成向后兼容 shim,exec 转发到 sync-skills.sh,不破坏已写 post-sync 的项目。\n\n验证:A(本地树,零网络)、B(上游 sparse)、shim 转发、SKILLS 过滤均 exit 0;修了 EXIT\ntrap 末句非零在 set -e 下误报退出码的坑。","tree":{"sha":"0bc266b21e88a65d0c6dc6520731fbb43cd06094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/0bc266b21e88a65d0c6dc6520731fbb43cd06094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/821cbccb6d48824c064f698e8f947f0026c4d856","verification":{"payload":"tree 0bc266b21e88a65d0c6dc6520731fbb43cd06094\nparent 8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790894003 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790894003 -0500\n\n澄清 aurora 的两种消费方式,并将 skill 分发解耦为独立 sync-skills.sh (#77)\n\n* docs(consume): 澄清消费 aurora 的两种方式 —— go get 默认,整树 vendor+改 import 仅防逆向\n\n此前文档默认把「make sync-aurora → 整棵树 vendor 进 third_party/aurora + 改 import 路径」\n当成唯一消费方式,容易误把它当通用必须。实则两条路径:\n\n- ① 默认(绝大多数项目):go get 直接依赖,不改 import、不 replace;只有 go vendor 带不走\n  的非 .go 源(前端 web / 迁移 .sql)才窄同步——只拷那几个目录进 third_party/aurora,不拷\n  Go、不改 import。⚠️ third_party/aurora 文件夹存在 ≠ 走了②,区分看有没有改 import/replace。\n- ② 身份隐藏(仅防逆向):整树 vendor + 把 import 改名到中立 host(如 bitbucket),唯一目的\n  是在交付/暴露产物里藏住上游身份(garble 的后继);没这需求一律用①。判据:import 写\n  github.com/shyandsy 还是中立 host / go.mod require 还是 replace。\n\n改动:README 新增权威节「消费 aurora:两种方式」(含判据、②的防逆向目的、skill 分发与代码\n消费正交及①怎么拿脚本);user-module-migration SKILL §7 把 skill 到达口径收窄到②。\n全程不写具体消费项目名。\n\n* feat(skills): skill 分发收口到独立 sync-skills.sh —— 与代码消费正交\n\nskill 分发原本寄生在②的「整树 vendor + post-sync 从 third_party/aurora/.claude/skills\n镜像」上,逼着只想要个 skill 的①项目去上②的整套 vendoring —— 这正是「把②当默认」的误导源。\n拆开,让拿 skill 和怎么消费 aurora 代码彻底无关:\n\n- 新增 scripts/sync-skills.sh:把 aurora 的 .claude/skills 同步进消费项目根 .claude/skills/,\n  不碰 go.mod/third_party。两种取源自动择一——A 本地有 third_party/aurora 树(②)则零网络\n  镜像;B 否则从上游只 sparse-checkout .claude/skills @REF(①正路),不下 Go/web 源、不建\n  third_party。支持 SKILLS=\"a b\" 只同步部分。\n- ① 项目怎么拿到本脚本:它是零依赖单文件,拷一份进自己仓 scripts/ 即可(这不是 vendor\n  aurora),堵掉「为拿脚本回头 clone/vendor 整个 aurora」的坑。\n- scripts/post-sync.sh 收成向后兼容 shim,exec 转发到 sync-skills.sh,不破坏已写 post-sync 的项目。\n\n验证:A(本地树,零网络)、B(上游 sparse)、shim 转发、SKILLS 过滤均 exit 0;修了 EXIT\ntrap 末句非零在 set -e 下误报退出码的坑。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvt+0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOrMQABI4x5bQMvspCgzVsbWZdbXz\nO4pR36lHlmvF5EAlR02roQjT4UMzB1XQrRS/0FFvf0Bqgf+ji/yLoNnbnpgt3t9Z\nUtK62RxXuaqeW/NZ0g/wDfVwUvrzEzV0pee3pj4X4Edpe4Bw1txsSuaSjk+5TdXQ\n2B9GI7AplADjiyBoxemp08n7oz1Vw4++28vVRrunqAwhNkavX9RIy/SL64ZI91PL\nk6oGMTaSjJ3YLTj3a6rGWfHMuML7BSbbBartxFWPVQAChp/vp/WvRsKI+2R873Go\nlu/Vlee3VdbTqeNp+bjszsU1bdKc3gsfjOFotGVUy9X9i8CxhEECXJDaquMWtTSs\n0rKCi9X7T6LCh8IY1BDyJXNrNR8QajbbwspaYgPEFJFeyrXbhOT2bws9wEqj+QLn\nn/81+5mtrB0nNRm13kobgOLO9yH2cJk6YCd8CjU7ztPzNxsqwD5f9vUV+LzRzbFn\nkshZP+goDdX/rIG3xZt/1sr6thHgAoHPpLeUYk2MNTMtfxNSR8ZvC/Khdsj6zmf7\ncdWdsjDybwkoRQKNrnoOX9M97lIEVvtVVviVrc42jds8J1fu9AlXxfbTG3/pwPwV\n86elNDyFDR+sAKijyp4ojhSa4/1AV9HmD2il/xr9xDVCb2RNy0tKeB5woBQtPKE9\njzwrGJdoRjcpa/G9lTfU\n=sj20\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T22:33:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/821cbccb6d48824c064f698e8f947f0026c4d856","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKDgyMWNiY2NiNmQ0ODgyNGMwNjRmNjk4ZThmOTQ3ZjAwMjZjNGQ4NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac","sha":"8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac"}],"sha":"821cbccb6d48824c064f698e8f947f0026c4d856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/821cbccb6d48824c064f698e8f947f0026c4d856"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:30:52Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:30:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(skills): 新增 design-nav —— 跨项目统一的 UI 设计导航模式 (#76)\n\n面向消费者的 skill(随 aurora sync + post-sync.sh 分发进各项目根 .claude/skills/,\n同 user-module-migration)。让任一基于 aurora 的项目都能产出组织统一、规范先行、\n内容清晰的合格设计文档。skill 不假设用户是哪个项目,全用通用占位。\n\n产出与运行环境(钉死):\n- ⛔ 绝不发 claude.ai artifact(除非用户明确开口要):产出写进项目 git 仓库的文件\n  (壳 index.html + 子页 d/*.html),版本化、可自托管、脱离 claude(账号/订阅没了也在)。\n- 本地看 = python3 -m http.server -d <nav> 0(端口 0 自动挑空闲口、启动打印;多项目同时跑不撞)。\n  走 http://localhost;file:// 下 iframe 同源被拦,别双击 index.html。\n\n组织(六条铁律):规范先行(第一个端必为「规范·Tokens」)/ 用壳模板别从头写 /\n顶层只放「端」、子菜单做缩进子组、照真实 sidebar 列全 / 列全+标覆盖率 / 一个导航不碎片化 / 全宽。\n\n设计质量:规范页必含五类(字号/字色/语义色/边框圆角间距/组件样例,各带可照抄 class);\n画稿铁律六条(先读真实 *.component.html 1:1 还原、只用规范 token、设计==实现、真实内容非 lorem、\n一页画全状态/弹窗、移动端手机框 web 全宽画布)。\n\n按场景的执行流程(7 场景,各可直接照做):①新建项目从零(greenfield)②已有项目按规范重整\n③新增一页 ④新增/优化局部 ⑤设计与实现漂移同步 ⑥菜单/路由变更同步 ⑦并入外部/claude 稿。\n适用范围与边界:主场=已实现的 app;greenfield 需配 artifact-design(设计系统)+ 产品 IA;\n存量 mockup 合格化是逐页返工别低估。\n\n交付物:SKILL.md(运行环境+适用范围+六条铁律+规范页必含+画稿铁律+子页机制 iframe 非 splice\n+按场景流程+合格验收)+ template/index.html(全项目统一导航壳,只改 ENDS 数据 + 两处项目名,\n不动 CSS/JS → 组织天然统一;完整 standalone 带 head)。\n\ndoctrine:壳模板+组织+设计规则归 aurora;各项目实例(仓库路径/sidebar 路径/子页清单)归各项目。","tree":{"sha":"d618d22776320c56eb555d7031f4be272eedbf1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/d618d22776320c56eb555d7031f4be272eedbf1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/8658276e5ade7c0a546c476e5beeeb87d51ec1ac","verification":{"payload":"tree d618d22776320c56eb555d7031f4be272ee