): Config 支持注入 LoginPolicyProvider,登录限流阈值可运行时可配 (#70)\n\nmodules/user 原先登录限流阈值编译期写死(StaticPolicy + AcctLockSeconds=900),\nConfig 无口子——接入项目要\"改设置即生效\"的运行时可调阈值就没法接(deploy #406 已\n在本地实现:DBProvider 读设置表 + 设置页卡片,切到本模块会丢这能力)。\n\n本 PR 把这能力上游成通用口子:\n- Config 增可选字段 LoginPolicyProvider(loginguard.LoginPolicyProvider):\n  - 留空 → 内置 StaticPolicy(DefaultPolicy + AcctLockSeconds=900),**现行行为、零回归**;\n  - 传值 → 用宿主自己的实现(如从设置表读、内存缓存的 provider),阈值改设置即生效。\n- feature.go 经 resolveLoginPolicyProvider(cfg) 决定来源(留空回落默认),其余装配不变。\n- 账号硬锁 vs 只计数仍由 provider 返回的 LoginPolicy.AcctLockSeconds 编码;loginguard\n  feature 启动仍校验初始快照自洽。\n\n测试:resolveLoginPolicyProvider 留空回落硬锁默认(AcctLockSeconds=900、其余=DefaultPolicy)/\n传值原样透传。go build ./... + go test ./modules/user/ 全绿,gofmt 干净。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb69d6f72af6b3f815ca816e58725377d72f4d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/cb69d6f72af6b3f815ca816e58725377d72f4d43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/4bbbd18791b19754dfbc18364b9f2dddc98401ed","verification":{"payload":"tree cb69d6f72af6b3f815ca816e58725377d72f4d43\nparent e9a1db0df01c45482117be01982d50b8058e06d2\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790730843 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790730843 -0400\n\nfeat(user): Config 支持注入 LoginPolicyProvider,登录限流阈值可运行时可配 (#70)\n\nmodules/user 原先登录限流阈值编译期写死(StaticPolicy + AcctLockSeconds=900),\nConfig 无口子——接入项目要\"改设置即生效\"的运行时可调阈值就没法接(deploy #406 已\n在本地实现:DBProvider 读设置表 + 设置页卡片,切到本模块会丢这能力)。\n\n本 PR 把这能力上游成通用口子:\n- Config 增可选字段 LoginPolicyProvider(loginguard.LoginPolicyProvider):\n  - 留空 → 内置 StaticPolicy(DefaultPolicy + AcctLockSeconds=900),**现行行为、零回归**;\n  - 传值 → 用宿主自己的实现(如从设置表读、内存缓存的 provider),阈值改设置即生效。\n- feature.go 经 resolveLoginPolicyProvider(cfg) 决定来源(留空回落默认),其余装配不变。\n- 账号硬锁 vs 只计数仍由 provider 返回的 LoginPolicy.AcctLockSeconds 编码;loginguard\n  feature 启动仍校验初始快照自洽。\n\n测试:resolveLoginPolicyProvider 留空回落硬锁默认(AcctLockSeconds=900、其余=DefaultPolicy)/\n传值原样透传。go build ./... + go test ./modules/user/ 全绿,gofmt 干净。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvGJbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+6kQAJYhIL/GIFgrOBbRA51nTyL+\n1IjrN7BmNONbh3gyiw+roccFCjgnxuNawfOpCrEDcI8pOtuxRDfH3ERmAYuTCXrz\ntqfsnUwBq0YpbabF0Vd5jlRVPdW44FWv7yFRbTQynH1U9O4Lvx5BWU2qWqgQEGOr\n7B9QzzgibP2T2cuvrgcFnz8gnnvolTGNK+QDVWxAs51q4UqeEQSAZx4B788h5E6w\nwZD2g+62NLwlXeD9McmdPpDu976QU3zLDXEf14xRLHpR8CTaoB3EaDWMeTOSoblz\nqj0EIRMfUxLC+KBtWHlndJwqk3gfqubswJIzzUcul0OOEVKBO01oluiFTO/onPfU\nROyiNV1/Dblw0pQ+IomAt18tExgtAlq3ioKlqYsue1QPM6Dxx/6AjQFYK1SlutMu\nJ0/O9DR7JT7+487VBD1vrVeLttPDEbNdnBmD9Byzq+2DhIxS0qOHtNSLDGaAFUfv\nofuT9iFo1NciBL/HP7/i5D904kBoZZf2I7doTLmINn9Gah0YtY2GLkyw4NYtenBV\nqbIG9KnvS102XW8rM9F/FTCJ0j8C/sKSGlKfrHXm2KbVOHi69HH4Y4gy8I3lub++\nqtD6+ob/FxAZwGLi3Usv97PQTZv1no5IZ8NW57dINTTEV9IRYArS8QGB+w25Fkra\n2U2ltT6OjqpQqiTb5aiY\n=oBzy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T01:14:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public