 + Project/Deployment 身份 + 授权)收口成 aurora\nfeature,在其上提供三样:\n- ① serving 门:验签裁决 → 按策略随机注入 500 降级(不 os.Exit/不杀 pod),配 NTS 可信时钟\n  + 启动期时间门 + 落盘恢复。这层是「软骚扰」——抬成本/可吊销,但可 patch,光靠它不防搬走。\n- ② SignViaControl:请 control 用其持有的私钥**代签关键数据**、取回签名——key 永在 control,\n  本 feature 不持不缓存、只转发;未授权/吊销的副本签不出有效数据 = 产不出正确输出(不是可 patch\n  的判断,是它根本没有的能力)。这是真正的安全牙齿。典型用例:签 App 引导配置。\n- ③(后续)取运营材料。\n\n包住 sealkit/guard(续约传输 HTTPRenewer + 公钥解码 DecodePub),不吞并;依赖单向 controlgate→sealkit。\n\n对外契约:Gate(FaultRate/ServingState/AuthorizedUntil/SignViaControl)+ Config;实现私有。\n\nSignViaControl wire:POST {RenewBaseURL}/projects/{proj}/deployments/{dep}/appconfig/sign\n(与 renewer 同身份命名空间,per-deployment 授权复用),请求 {payload:base64,projectUuid,\ndeploymentId} → 响应 {sig:base64},原样返回 sig(不验 sig,那是 App 内置公钥的事)。授权失败/\n吊销(401/403)/不可达/响应异常 → error(fail-closed,绝不返回伪造签名);disabledGate 直接 error。\ncontrol 服务端(保管私钥+授权+吊销)跨仓、不在本 PR。\n\n时间门硬化:统一启动期时间门(默认 2min 可配;配 NTS 时 never-seen 也须先拿 fresh,堵删-state\n白嫖)、认证时间门/air-gap、坐标全空分级 fail-startup、路由时序自守卫、exempt 可配+尾斜杠容忍。\n\ngo.mod:require sealkit/beevik-ntp/beevik-nts/prometheus;sealkit(go 1.26)带动 go 指令 1.26,\nCI go-version 同步;go mod tidy + vendor。\n\n测试 37 例。文档:README(三问讲清 SignViaControl 为何是真牙齿 + appconfig 范例)+ doc/features\n+ 根 README 名录 + doc/README 表。","tree":{"sha":"d91f211da3a2805d038a903ea8803dfbd7c4cff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/d91f211da3a2805d038a903ea8803dfbd7c4cff8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/e9a1db0df01c45482117be01982d50b8058e06d2","verification":{"payload":"tree d91f211da3a2805d038a903ea8803dfbd7c4cff8\nparent 736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790728829 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790728829 -0400\n\nfeat(controlgate): 可信授权门禁 + control 认证通道 feature(wrap sealkit/guard + SignViaControl) (#65)\n\n把服务实例到 control 的认证通道(RenewBaseURL + Project/Deployment 身份 + 授权)收口成 aurora\nfeature,在其上提供三样:\n- ① serving 门:验签裁决 → 按策略随机注入 500 降级(不 os.Exit/不杀 pod),配 NTS 可信时钟\n  + 启动期时间门 + 落盘恢复。这层是「软骚扰」——抬成本/可吊销,但可 patch,光靠它不防搬走。\n- ② SignViaControl:请 control 用其持有的私钥**代签关键数据**、取回签名——key 永在 control,\n  本 feature 不持不缓存、只转发;未授权/吊销的副本签不出有效数据 = 产不出正确输出(不是可 patch\n  的判断,是它根本没有的能力)。这是真正的安全牙齿。典型用例:签 App 引导配置。\n- ③(后续)取运营材料。\n\n包住 sealkit/guard(续约传输 HTTPRenewer + 公钥解码 DecodePub),不吞并;依赖单向 controlgate→sealkit。\n\n对外契约:Gate(FaultRate/ServingState/AuthorizedUntil/SignViaControl)+ Config;实现私有。\n\nSignViaControl wire:POST {RenewBaseURL}/projects/{proj}/deployments/{dep}/appconfig/sign\n(与 renewer 同身份命名空间,per-deployment 授权复用),请求 {payload:base64,projectUuid,\ndeploymentId} → 响应 {sig:base64},原样返回 sig(不验 sig,那是 App 内置公钥的事)。授权失败/\n吊销(401/403)/不可达/响应异常 → error(fail-closed,绝不返回伪造签名);disabledGate 直接 error。\ncontrol 服务端(保管私钥+授权+吊销)跨仓、不在本 PR。\n\n时间门硬化:统一启动期时间门(默认 2min 可配;配 NTS 时 never-seen 也须先拿 fresh,堵删-state\n白嫖)、认证时间门/air-gap、坐标全空分级 fail-startup、路由时序自守卫、exempt 可配+尾斜杠容忍。\n\ngo.mod:require sealkit/beevik-ntp/beevik-nts/prometheus;sealkit(go 1.26)带动 go 指令 1.26,\nCI go-version 同步;go mod tidy + vendor。\n\n测试 37 例。文档:README(三问讲清 SignViaControl 为何是真牙齿 + appconfig 范例)+ doc/features\n+ 根 README 名录 + doc/README 表。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvFp9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm8sQAEUCKn9aIQYfGRTomeBGhx8X\njHnEDnmIfzor4sB9ngIMF7a27cM5wFFAFpJqh1yW0KMiN5UAfNx4wk24xNnHrJJx\n6hfLW/pYTH3qmF7vHgHu28gVBln5FhWcCiD1YkhYjgZiFIS+A/ZQIACdQPUIzxWB\nD2FNCbn8hyvO50MSS/7Q5/bsxqMNLTwUFIjUBsO67DkfGbvX6YY1fk5smaUn3YsH\nMI/XrAQZNGhHSdX+SH8zEzXt5TLeXyOhULKPD0+CkQ9Zd7Km1D4pYS11i/d2atAH\nGYoCETHnbasVCMm/o5lltKZl34keE+AkEjWbw3OzGRh+GW8Oz6xjwOUOra0vxOtN\niQTC0eQsKfdTTj9CsA8xNvyItUUYvL368AtewDJIbHjQq17B2iOTssKAfI//MEHG\nceWvCR3aoxgWcU6E6rjy3WtvdSYwo//rOH/kZ+tEo22fyyXXm9OM/BivP0qZdH9m\nHriTKItvWSQmZNEmKlyvdyZFBMQWp0zUAH+Tq+mGhYcdoQbi1DcybvxOJap7wDdT\n4s6WiBbu26SdNqILYQ3A4NKFPz4/mHlAnXro63HnqZR2g626i9JD7zzDJnQOXPKY\nB6QX9uxNFxhPbSNc9nn1QsKlBViocYLvSje0k/haEwbe1i785MxT6LTEiDDg1vzy\n+VBsiDGge7tEAjSE/YMU\n=YqW8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T00:40:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/e9a1db0df01c45482117be01982d50b8058e06d2","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKGU5YTFkYjBkZjAxYzQ1NDgyMTE3YmUwMTk4MmQ1MGI4MDU4ZTA2ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f","sha":"736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f"}],"sha":"e9a1db0df01c45482117be01982d50b8058e06d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/e9a1db0df01c45482117be01982d50b8058e06d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:15:35Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T21:15:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(user): user 中心 + 共享通用件搬进 aurora (#68)\n\n* feat(user): user 中心 + 共享通用件搬进 aurora\n\n把多项目共用的「后台账号中心」收口成 aurora 里的一份共享代码,各项目\nsync 后换 Config 挂载即可,永不重写。\n\n- modules/user/:完整服务模块(package user),对外只暴露\n  NewFeature(Config) / Routes(app) / Config 三个入口;内含 account+RBAC、\n  登录 + 2FA(TOTP)、会话/设备清单、微服务 token、gate、登录防护\n  (建在 aurora loginguard/tokenguard 上)、goose 迁移、三语文案。\n  差异全走 Config(TOTPKeyEnv/GateCookie/RateLimitNamespace/TablePrefix)。\n- 顶层共享库(所有服务可用):\n  - middleware/:JWT 鉴权中间件 + rolefeature/ 子包\n  - encryption/:AES-256-GCM 凭据加解密(密钥调用方注入,纯算法库),\n    含完整测试(派生/往返/篡改/错密钥/短密文/nonce 唯一)\n  - types/:业务无关通用类型(JSON 列 / 分页 DTO / 状态枚举)\n- 中立化:不含任何宿主业务名/域名/tier;拖 tier 的限流中间件留在宿主。\n\n* docs(user): 共享 user 中心文档(设计稿 + README 索引)\n\n- doc/proposals/shared-user-center.md:设计稿(决策/结构/功能/用法/\n  中立化/Schema 跨项目治理政策/迁移计划/待办);前端源码进\n  modules/user/web/、消费一份共享 remote 别各拷;middleware 去业务化列待办。\n- README.md:补「可挂载服务模块」区 + 共享库(middleware/encryption/types)。\n- modules/README.md:feature vs modules 区别 + web/ 共置约定 + 模块索引。\n- modules/user/README.md:模块自述(功能/用法/入口/结构/前端/治理待办)。\n\n* refactor(user): namespace 收归引擎 + 启动 schema 闸 + 清死配置/改名残留\n\n一批 modules/user 硬化(config.go 与 feature.go 被多点触及,合并为一个可编译整提):\n\n- namespace 收归引擎:删掉 Config.RateLimitNamespace 旋钮(user 模块不该决定分区键);\n  loginguard 传空 → 自动 SERVICE_NAME;登录失败索引与后台被锁列表的 key 改问\n  loginguard.Guard.Namespace() 取同一前缀,和真正的锁单一源、不再脱钩(修原写死\n  \"rate_limit:user:index\" 在 namespace≠user 时静默坏的隐患)。含单测锁死 key 由 ns 派生。\n- 启动 schema 闸(schema_guard.go):Setup 里从各 entity 自省(TableName + gorm tag)\n  校验所需表/列都在,不满足即 FATAL —— 存量接入 baseline 写漏号/表 drift/goose 源\n  指错,第一次启动就死,不带病跑。只查结构不查内容。含测试(齐全/缺表/缺列/空库)。\n- 删死配置:Config.TablePrefix 全代码没人读,且 GOOSE_TABLE_PREFIX 只前缀版本表、\n  从不碰业务表,留着字段会误导,删除并改为注释说明。\n- 清改名残留:userCenterFeature→userFeature、Name() 返 \"user\"、注释里 usercenter→\n  user 模块、common/secret→encryption 包。\n\n* chore(aurora): user 迁移 skill + sync 分发机制 + .gitignore 放行 skills\n\n- .claude/skills/user-module-migration:接入 playbook(schema/data 归属、三种存量\n  情况判定、启动 schema 闸、host 声明式 feature 注册表、verify/baseline)。\n- scripts/post-sync.sh:消费项目 sync 后把随仓分发的 skill 镜像进项目根 .claude/skills/\n  (agent 只扫项目根;逻辑收口 aurora 单一源,各项目 sync-aurora 只加一行调用)。\n- .gitignore:.claude/* 但放行 .claude/skills/,让面向消费者的 skill 随仓入库、随 sync 分发。","tree":{"sha":"b0273684c529b8d9f9fe7d120aecd378545223c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/b0273684c529b8d9f9fe7d120aecd378545223c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/736818fe985f53978f3e250cfba36da63dddf72f","verification":{"payload":"tree b0273684c529b8d9f9fe7d120aecd378545223c3\nparent c954533131f36c0c4de08e074e96a767bc7f67bd\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790716535 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790716535 -0400\n\nfeat(user): user 中心 + 共享通用件搬进 aurora (#68)\n\n* feat(user): user 中心 + 共享通用件搬进 aurora\n\n把多项目共用的「后台账号中心」收口成 aurora 里的一份共享代码,各项目\nsync 后换 Config 挂载即可,永不重写。\n\n- modules/user/:完整服务模块(package user),对外只暴露\n  NewFeature(Config) / Routes(app) / Config 三个入口;内含 account+RBAC、\n  登录 + 2FA(TOTP)、会话/设备清单、微服务 token、gate、登录防护\n  (建在 aurora loginguard/tokenguard 上)、goose 迁移、三语文案。\n  差异全走 Config(TOTPKeyEnv/GateCookie/RateL