ogin":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/205584f52ceb66ff0eadddd04ef2fe949d688db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:09:14Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:09:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(loginguard,ratelimit): Guard.Unlock 强制解锁 + Decision.RetryAfter (#61)\n\n供后台「被锁列表」的解锁按钮用,以及登录被拦时给客户端精确 Retry-After。\n\n- ratelimit.Service.Unlock(b FailLockBucket, dims):清失败计数 + 锁 key(比 ClearFail 多清 lock)。\n- loginguard.Guard.Unlock(ip, account):运维强制解锁,清 IP 与账号两边的失败计数 + 锁;\n  每小时成功配额(IPPerHour)不动(那是滑动配额、不是锁)。\n- Decision 加 RetryAfter:PrecheckIP/PrecheckAccount 被锁时带上建议等待秒数(供 Retry-After 头)。\n- 测试:TestUnlock(锁→RetryAfter>0→Unlock→不再锁)。","tree":{"sha":"c170495835d32422ee5c3e32dbdecf7bba9d6e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/c170495835d32422ee5c3e32dbdecf7bba9d6e85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/205584f52ceb66ff0eadddd04ef2fe949d688db5","verification":{"payload":"tree c170495835d32422ee5c3e32dbdecf7bba9d6e85\nparent 5e24e650eab0939f16871d572bc5208037a3cf39\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790615354 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790615354 -0400\n\nfeat(loginguard,ratelimit): Guard.Unlock 强制解锁 + Decision.RetryAfter (#61)\n\n供后台「被锁列表」的解锁按钮用,以及登录被拦时给客户端精确 Retry-After。\n\n- ratelimit.Service.Unlock(b FailLockBucket, dims):清失败计数 + 锁 key(比 ClearFail 多清 lock)。\n- loginguard.Guard.Unlock(ip, account):运维强制解锁,清 IP 与账号两边的失败计数 + 锁;\n  每小时成功配额(IPPerHour)不动(那是滑动配额、不是锁)。\n- Decision 加 RetryAfter:PrecheckIP/PrecheckAccount 被锁时带上建议等待秒数(供 Retry-After 头)。\n- 测试:TestUnlock(锁→RetryAfter>0→Unlock→不再锁)。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqup86CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmYIQAEVlvGhRPU1O1gwxSnpbzG0i\nRqhATtiCOXyUjhAUBDUMBBkNeZ4axENlA2N6ot9KkgwHoG/0/DcNOaoe+kKOAvdL\nV1NEZ3+R4xZtayB0BGg92wgwWl8+7VTsJSthy29HUeCAMUmw7eA4Ex569+Eo4PMd\nxyjJA62LeKGKwWGU/35ppQGRZ+4HWjQJbbSGt7JzvYvw9VgaGR/5zh4LEIAOAlUO\n8QsFuXRxpbqmIAVB+uBlOdb1LAVCzCQBLlkx2MjnSuz8yZZfGv3EoyhA2SLUVg9m\nkESIsLlnCRaUvJM6eLulbmwPgwB5a7D729BTKlKPeAzCbdk8R4ojrTX1zR5472Y8\nB1oPAN6CIFoHQS/xedoBk2Qzv+0OGxq3jBinQLqjUMZcbAsnle0KQQLywyx5PKuB\nHc6MDP6YTDa1Uc9KK2p/HXa8kPXhNyoPb200GJvGGmV2w6HBP3TcxK1I8k/CnFmG\nYFxAOogezEd0ezT+G/667Jmatb0tYqUpXVLyCilIJhqyXi4NsJUYSCrKV0mFdYDF\nfXoBFIR862IVB6q9wjEWrWYy83N/0SvO8Kjhtcsr+ZPU5O6YAnim6N93WtJbGMVC\nYPrBoO0SqOpg6alIUjWSiqrBVYZdn/AHM84ZREsSFfUXqG+sj7eoT+P744+S6Pmx\nK1JetoSJmliIKBoI0UmO\n=cu8Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T17:09:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","ty