olicy 返回指针(可空),否则 di.ProvideAs panic (#60)\n\nStaticLimits/StaticPolicy 之前返回结构体值。di.ProvideAs 注册实例时会 reflect.ValueOf(x).IsNil()\n校验,对结构体值直接 panic(reflect: call of reflect.Value.IsNil on struct Value)——build 不报,\n消费方一 ProvideAs 就装配崩(user 服务上 eng 启动即 crash)。改成返回指针(可空)根治。\n各加一个回归测试锁住「必须可空」不变量。","tree":{"sha":"941f45aa0f78aa2aff248f4da3e003e8cc58f025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/941f45aa0f78aa2aff248f4da3e003e8cc58f025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/5e24e650eab0939f16871d572bc5208037a3cf39","verification":{"payload":"tree 941f45aa0f78aa2aff248f4da3e003e8cc58f025\nparent 0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790612897 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790612897 -0400\n\nfix(ratelimit,loginguard): StaticLimits/StaticPolicy 返回指针(可空),否则 di.ProvideAs panic (#60)\n\nStaticLimits/StaticPolicy 之前返回结构体值。di.ProvideAs 注册实例时会 reflect.ValueOf(x).IsNil()\n校验,对结构体值直接 panic(reflect: call of reflect.Value.IsNil on struct Value)——build 不报,\n消费方一 ProvideAs 就装配崩(user 服务上 eng 启动即 crash)。改成返回指针(可空)根治。\n各加一个回归测试锁住「必须可空」不变量。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqupWhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7boQABIDAyHyMjnlnIE7SH7kzt70\nieZVN/xY+lIr2HAxyJw04tc59H1mzxt8wdugdH02dRRQnhMezM0fQNkcOhFXbnq4\nFOHA4F4gIyL1OnmBvGDersi9bjYw5YVR0XlW6CKO6ZGnSLEMyWC+WutDggOSxKwY\nk5tapkvO9TNv1fNxHGj/gT8anr8SYFxi5vmjysKq8cxeIcgzDV9KuClbCQ9dQz+P\nTYENVJ8eYh8JWOISGs5HqVudBGdmlwZ6FzNvFKJvPDwRl3PkVpHbuznuTe26O9KY\njCiCYRkblyxKAxoULNL8p5Y0uEUXviypy0q4vwgeFiXk3o9O/l3ZHdzKdZvRNg7S\nYFEV+kg8I+n14udEMNsIfxmMinFHqhDGF8OBXP54bc37BL8N7WQL7+lIWVBaolij\nn7W9sXm71i9VBmPntYTfGi0tctR6J6owb6gDBSq0E/nJQum3QjQSV8of0D1CjKvb\n8IsPePvIta8rw6xhCci9BU/I8CRzvpYR2EssF4gdQXEAEGE3oPB2C5WuxkociNNI\nWkRaPKxOcpjPTA2AVUN18DmRGWF28MZi7Fe5oWO+B8iVujfds5IQE1CFchKM+Txl\nIJsBSZcHbFL1uquFY1H5RKaAKp/p5RMjgD37gYR1Yue3KYiGF3dmTbw5TJt4lH7F\ng4ORkpX8JUrU9F5IZbcr\n=7IVU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T16:28:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/5e24e650eab0939f16871d572bc5208037a3cf39","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKDVlMjRlNjUwZWFiMDkzOWYxNjg3MWQ1NzJiYzUyMDgwMzdhM2NmMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064","sha":"0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064"}],"sha":"5e24e650eab0939f16871d572bc5208037a3cf39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/5e24e650eab0939f16871d572bc5208037a3cf39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:51:37Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:51:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ratelimit): 计数地基 + loginguard 建在其上 + 防护体系总设计 (#58)\n\n* feat(ratelimit): 计数地基 feature(类型化桶句柄 + 原子 Lua + 可复用引擎)\n\n防护体系的计数地基:按不透明 key 在窗口内做计数/失败锁/冷却,不认识任何\n业务概念(login/register/email…),登录爆破锁、注册/发信限频、重发冷却都建其上。\n\n- 类型化桶句柄 NewCountBucket/NewFailLockBucket/NewCooldownBucket:桶名不可能\n  typo、调错方法(对 CountBucket 调 Fail)=编译错,从根上消灭\"桶没注册/调错\n  方法却 fail-open 静默关限流\"。\n- 原子 Lua incr(INCR + 仅首次 PEXPIRE 毫秒,经 RedisService.Eval 一条脚本):杜绝\n  INCR 与过期设置分两条、中间 key 过期被重建成无 TTL → 永久锁死 = 自我 DoS;用\n  PEXPIRE 毫秒而非整秒,亚秒窗口也如实不被截成 0(EXPIRE 0 = 立即删键 = 静默失效)。\n- 维度值转义(:/=/% → %3A/%3D/%25):保证 key 对(维度,值)单射,防 IPv6 冒号/串桶。\n- key 前缀用完整 rate_limit(不缩写 rl):redis key 要运维肉眼看/grep(手动解锁),\n  且与既有 key 约定一致;namespace 必填(位置参数)→ rate_limit:<ns>:...,多服务共库不撞键。\n- NewEngine(redis, namespace, provider):兄弟 feature(如 loginguard)在自己包内复用\n  这份计数地基的入口,不经 app/DI;PeekFail 只读失败计数(预检取 remaining 不记失败)。\n- redis 能力直接依赖 redis feature 的 RedisService(契约单一真源,不另抄最小接口)。\n- 测试:fakeRedis 单测 + miniredis 集成测试(原子 Lua 真实 TTL 语义 + 亚秒窗口回归)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(loginguard): 建在 ratelimit 引擎上,不再自带计数\n\n- 删掉 loginguard 自带的 incr/count/key/原子脚本,内部改持一个 ratelimit 引擎\n  (ratelimit.NewEngine):声明 3 个登录桶(IP 失败锁 / IP 每小时上限 / 账号失败锁)\n  + 用 LoginPolicy 适配成引擎的 LimitsProvider。全体系只有一份计数实现。\n- 对外 Guard 接口与登录语义一字未变(Precheck/Record*、账号硬锁 vs 只计数、\n  RecordPending 清账号保留 IP 都保持);计数/锁/TTL/原子性/key 隔离全由地基负责。\n- NewLoginGuardFeature 增 namespace 位置参数(透传引擎做 key 前缀 rate_limit:<ns>:...)。\n- 内部 key 格式随之从 rate_limit:login:* 变为 rate_limit:<ns>:login_*(只影响 loginguard\n  内部;消费方只调 Guard 接口不受影响)。guard 的引擎字段命名为 engine(不缩写)。\n- 测试改走公开 Guard 面断言(不再窥探内部 key);miniredis 集成测试验端到端行为\n  + 守住失败键带 TTL、非永久键的反自我-DoS 回归。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: aurora 门面能力总览 + doc 分类(features/topics/building)+ 防护体系总设计\n\n- README/doc/README:门面级能力总览,按消费方式分类,任何 agent 接手都能看清有什么、怎么用。\n- doc/topics/security-suite:防护体系总设计;ratelimit↔loginguard 收敛已完成、NewEngine\n  复用入口、redis 契约单一真源、key 前缀 rate_limit:<ns>: 等如实登记。\n- doc/features/{ratelimit,loginguard,tokenguard}、doc/building:各件消费文档(按实情写)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3033bf5045d0ea210c14800469cede6ddfddb05a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/3033bf5045d0ea210c14800469cede6ddfddb05a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/0694ab3cd7fa29afa87b7e271de218931f327064","verification":{"payload":"tree 3033bf5045d0ea210c14800469cede6ddfddb05a\nparent 056b9230206386dd6ae0cc6f65b9007e62acc78a\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790571097 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790571097 -0400\n\nfeat(ratelimit): 计数地基 + loginguard 建在其上 + 防护体系总设计 (#58)\n\n* feat(ratelimit): 计数地基 feature(类型化桶句柄 + 原子 Lua + 可复用引擎)\n\n防护体系的计数地基:按不透明 key 在窗口内做计数/失败锁/冷却,不认识任何\n业务概念(login/register/email…),登录爆破锁、注册/发信限频、重发冷却都建其上。\n\n- 类型化桶句柄 NewCountBucket/NewFailLockBucket/NewCooldownBucket:桶名不可能\n  typo、调错方法(对 CountBucket 调 Fail)=编译错,从根上消灭\"桶没注册/调错\n  方法却 fail-open 静默关限流\"。\n- 原子 Lua incr(INCR + 仅首次 PEXPIRE 毫秒,经 RedisService.Eval 一条脚本):杜绝\n  INCR 与过期设置分两条、中间 key 过期被重建成无 TTL → 永久锁死 = 自我 DoS;用\n  PEXPIRE 毫秒而非整秒,亚秒窗口也如实不被截成 0(EXPIRE 0 = 立即删键 = 静默失效)。\n- 维度值转义(:/=/% → %3A/%3D/%25):保证 key 对(维度,值)单射,防 IPv6 冒号/串桶。\n- key 前缀用完整 rate_limit(不缩写 rl):redis key 要运维肉眼看/grep(手动解锁),\n  且与既有 key 约定一致;namespace 必填(位置参数)→ rate_limit:<ns>:...,多服务共库不撞键。\n- NewEngine(redis, namespace, provider):兄弟 feature(如 loginguard)在自己包内复用\n  这份计数地基的入口,不经 app/DI;PeekFail 只读失败计数(预检取 remaining 不记失败)。\n- redis 能力直接依赖 redis feature 的 RedisService(契约单一真源,不另抄最小接口)。\n- 测试:fakeRedis 单测 + miniredis 集成测试(原子 Lua 真实 TTL 语义 + 亚秒窗口回归)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(loginguard): 建在 ratelimit 引擎上,不再自带计数\n\n- 删掉 loginguard 自带的 incr/count/key/原子脚本,内部改持一个 ratelimit 引擎\n  (ratelimit.NewEngine):声明 3 个登录桶(IP 失败锁 / IP 每小时上限 / 账号失败锁)\n  + 用 LoginPolicy 适配成引擎的 LimitsProvider。全体系只有一份计数实现。\n- 对外 Guard 接口与登录语义一字未变(Precheck/Record*、账号硬锁 vs 只计数、\n  RecordPending 清账号保留 IP 都保持);计数/锁/TTL/原子性/key 隔离全由地基负责。\n- NewLoginGuardFeature 增 namespace 位置参数(透传引擎做 key 前缀 rate_limit:<ns>:...)。\n- 内部 key 格式随之从 rate_limit:login:* 变为 rate_limit:<ns>:login_*(只影响 loginguard\n  内部;消费方只调 Guard 接口不受影响)。guard 的引擎字段命名为 engine(不缩写)。\n- 测试改走公开 Guard 面断言(不再窥探内部 key);miniredis 集成测试验端到端行为\n  + 守住失败键带 TTL、非永久键的反自我-DoS 回归。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: aurora 门面能力总览 + doc 分类(features/topics/building)+ 防护体系总设计\n\n- README/doc/README:门面级能力总览,按消费方式分类,任何 agent 接手都能看清有什么、怎么用。\n- doc/topics/security-suite:防护体系总设计;ratelimit↔loginguard 收敛已完成、NewEngine\n  复用入口、redis 契约单一真源、key 前缀 rate_limit:<ns>: 等如实登记。\n- doc/features/{ratelimit,loginguard,tokenguard}、doc/building:各件消费文档(按实情写)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqufJZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZUcQAJk/M5cCbK0xuqLYGwyoP