followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/f7c2c781af8d9b9bb06aa5d6c516c7ef199a0b19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:36:54Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:36:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(loginguard): RecordPending 只清账号失败、保留 IP,堵 IP 锁重置绕过 (#55)\n\nRecordPending(密码对、待 2FA 未完成)原先经 clearFailures 连同 IP 失败计数\n一起清。IP 计数是跨账号聚合的,某账号密码对不能证明同 IP 对其它账号的猜测善意;\n且 pending 不计每小时成功、不受 IPPerHour 约束,等于一个「不计量的 IP 计数重置\n原语」——持有任一有效密码者反复触发 pending 即可把 IP 失败计数归零、绕过 IP 锁去\n喷射爆破其它账号,尤其在账号只计数不硬锁(AcctLockSeconds=0)的公网形态下,IP 锁\n是唯一拦截,清 IP 等于拆掉它。\n\n改为 RecordPending 只 Delete 账号失败 key、保留 IP 失败计数(RecordSuccess 完成\n真登录时才连 IP 一起清)。补:改写 TestRecordPending 断言保留 IP、新增\nTestPendingCannotResetIPLock 回归(反复 pending 不得重置已触发的 IP 锁)。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8f5a2405d00b96a8759a928ea6c83db6c9d020e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/c8f5a2405d00b96a8759a928ea6c83db6c9d020e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/f7c2c781af8d9b9bb06aa5d6c516c7ef199a0b19","verification":{"payload":"tree c8f5a2405d00b96a8759a928ea6c83db6c9d020e\nparent 2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790523414 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790523414 -0400\n\nfix(loginguard): RecordPending 只清账号失败、保留 IP,堵 IP 锁重置绕过 (#55)\n\nRecordPending(密码对、待 2FA 未完成)原先经 clearFailures 连同 IP 失败计数\n一起清。IP 计数是跨账号聚合的,某账号密码对不能证明同 IP 对其它账号的猜测善意;\n且 pending 不计每小时成功、不受 IPPerHour 约束,等于一个「不计量的 IP 计数重置\n原语」——持有任一有效密码者反复触发 pending 即可把 IP 失败计数归零、绕过 IP 锁去\n喷射爆破其它账号,尤其在账号只计数不硬锁(AcctLockSeconds=0)的公网形态下,IP 锁\n是唯一拦截,清 IP 等于拆掉它。\n\n改为 RecordPending 只 Delete 账号失败 key、保留 IP 失败计数(RecordSuccess 完成\n真登录时才连 IP 一起清)。补:改写 TestRecordPending 断言保留 IP、新增\nTestPendingCannotResetIPLock 回归(反复 pending 不得重置已触发的 IP 锁)。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquTgWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA89IQAFF+FaxMQhh1KL5yz7Zz9sTL\nAB/IVMBLBk8zIkn3FaNr1GVO8nKa4GVIgvNBZk6NdpSGLEMqzXUD7uk7uS4AZHT1\nkUNUZc5uFJaivsQo+vGlpOBuyoafU1bPGHW7mYYzUj4XQ9TW4aZBX6H9BA4iHLhM\nWZr61Z2X9R8tn2aLyxTsmZzPAuTyZ+NxbrTMq4nBrHeNJ2YG9Cv9D4WUDbPe3mZE\nHlt6YHdrgpiQ3xqutZR+sp2fkNBRqaty+Is7Rd3Xbb9yK9DTM2HL7Lkq5mD4up74\nfS8FYMd8UWn0tW/1LIN6YLewF7/966FwW3+Rqw3Qri2/VD9gK3lHjMTnCU421dDn\nh18YK2ul5eYWCZzfBIyM7uxjY/f+eH9jmaNVsjPH4CFs5rRVktjihsOUYewuTubm\numRWGKlKib8V6WSNSBlBjQtKGXjYP9ASNjOctL8JRIIgQaiErFtNa1/Bkv5Sikiq\nIMJhypPSyEfrXnEaSgPGTtAycHdtphLL9BUyokgKYWGMxdwvww/8/maA5+oOf0A8\nuYO9NnfT5TYNd9yKhoNs1lxV7u07XXvhDVlj/WlWiM/w3FE851JKMAOyYODiVAq/\n4YYqJLr525MSfgOv/LKrrwPRyxib8gsPIDVHgR+T+K6M2wGR57GAFfPnb5rg599v\nOBM+bi2PBYScINy4TGF+\n=kcqR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T15:36:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/f7c2c781af8d9b9bb06aa5d6c516c7ef199a0b19","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKGY3YzJjNzgxYWY4ZDliOWJiMDZhYTVkNmM1MTZjN2VmMTk5YTBiMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb","sha":"2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb"}],"sha":"f7c2c781af8d9b9bb06aa5d6c516c7ef199a0b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/f7c2c781af8d9b9bb06aa5d6c516c7ef199a0b19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T13:34:14Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T13:34:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(loginguard): 登录暴力破解防护(aurora opt-in feature,防护三件套之「登录前」) (#53)\n\n三件套第二个:loginguard(登录前限流)/ tokenguard(登录后会话)/ doorman(请求级)。\n按 IP + 账号做登录失败计数、短期锁定、成功清理,收口限流策略与 Redis key 的单一真源。\n\n文件分三层:policy.go(策略)/ guard.go(机制)/ feature.go(装配)。\n\n对外只暴露 Guard + LoginPolicy/LoginPolicyProvider/StaticPolicy/DefaultPolicy + NewLoginGuardFeature;\nkey 格式、计数原语全不导出。Guard 说领域语言:\n  PrecheckIP / PrecheckAccount / RecordFailure / RecordSuccess / RecordPending\n(RecordPending = 密码对但未完成如待 2FA:清失败但不计成功;计数机制藏在包内,调用方只声明结局)。\n\n依赖全走 aurora DI:redis 与 LoginPolicyProvider 都 `inject:\"\"`,经 Setup 里 app.Resolve(f) 注入\n(构造函数不收 app、不收依赖 —— 同 jwt/tokenguard feature 契约:app 从 Setup(app) 进)。\nNewLoginGuardFeature() 无参;app 侧先 ProvideAs 自己的 LoginPolicyProvider(静态用 StaticPolicy)再 AddFeature。\n\n统一(一套代码喂 deploy user / homeserver user / homeserver customer,全靠 config):\n- 配置依赖倒置:只认 LoginPolicyProvider,不认任何产品的 SecurityConfig。静态用 StaticPolicy;\n  运行时可调(homeserver customer 的 SystemSettingService)自实现 provider(内存缓存,不碰 DB 热路径)。\n- 账号锁模式由 AcctLockSeconds 编码:>0 硬锁(deploy 管理台)/ =0 只计数(homeserver 公网,防 DoS 锁他人)/\n  AcctFailLimit<=0 关闭账号维度。账号标识(明文/哈希)由调用方传入的 account 决定。\n\n与 tokenguard 相反:运行时全程 fail-open(redis 挂→预检放行、记录 no-op,登录限流是次级防护,不能因\nredis 抖动把所有人锁在登录外);启动时 redis/provider 未配则 fail-startup(装配 bug 当场炸)。\n\n含全套单测(IP/账号硬锁、count-only、小时上限、成功清理、pending、remaining、fail-open)与 README。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"823bf5f3f55b686fedf95e1d50a6e202526aca4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/823bf5f3f55b686fedf95e1d50a6e202526aca4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/2c98f5c95d54256094048a3f93688ea955a860fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 823bf5f3f55b686fedf95e1d50a6e202526aca4e\nparent c7f8cf41f52cf35bad9e78ebaed36f6d1269615b\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790429654 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790429654 -0400\n\nfeat(loginguard): 登录暴力破解防护(aurora opt-in feature,防护三件套之「登录前」) (#53)\n\n三件套第二个:loginguard(登录前限流)/ tokenguard(登录后会话)/ doorman(请求级)。\n按 IP + 账号做登录失败计数、短期锁定、成功清理,收口限流策略与 Redis key 的单一真源。\n\n文件分三层:policy.go(策略)/ guard.go(机制)/ feature.go(装配)。\n\n对外只暴露 Guard + LoginPolicy/LoginPolicyProvider/StaticPolicy/DefaultPolicy + NewLoginGuardFeature;\nkey 格式、计数原语全不导出。Guard 说领域语言:\n  PrecheckIP / PrecheckAccount / RecordFailure / RecordSuccess / RecordPending\n(RecordPending = 密码对但未完成如待 2FA:清失败但不计成功;计数机制藏在包内,调用方只声明结局)。\n\n依赖全走 aurora DI:redis 与 LoginPolicyProvider 都 `inject:\"\"`,经 Setup 里 app.Resolve(f) 注入\n(构造函数不收 app、不收依赖 —— 同 jwt/tokenguard feature 契约:app 从 Setup(app) 进)。\nNewLoginGuardFeature() 无参;app 侧先 ProvideAs 自己的 LoginPolicyProvider(静态用 StaticPolicy)再 AddFeature。\n\n统一(一套代码喂 deploy user / homeserver user / homeserver customer,全靠 config):\n- 配置依赖倒置:只认 LoginPolicyProvider,不认任何产品的 SecurityConfig。静态用 StaticPolicy;\n  运行时可调(homeserver customer 的 SystemSettingService)自实现 provider(内存缓存,不碰 DB 热路径)。\n- 账号锁模式由 AcctLockSeconds 编码:>0 硬锁(deploy 管理台)/ =0 只计数(homeserver 公网,防 DoS 锁他人)/\n  AcctFailLimit<=0 关闭账号维度。账号标识(明文/哈希)由调用方传入的 account 决定。\n\n与 tokenguard 相反:运行时全程 fail-open(redis 挂→预检放行、记录 no-op,登录限流是次级防护,不能因\nredis 抖动把所有人锁在登录外);启动时 redis/provider 未配则 fail-startup(装配 bug 当场炸)。\n\n含全套单测(IP/账号硬锁、count-only、小时上限、成功清理、pending、remaining、fail-open)与 README。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt8nWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfqAQADvnUyl