ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/c7f8cf41f52cf35bad9e78ebaed36f6d1269615b","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKGM3ZjhjZjQxZjUyY2YzNWJhZDllNzhlYmFlZDM2ZjZkMTI2OTYxNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/4009db355c1f07805cffa8cfdcd2a5847d5fbcc9","sha":"4009db355c1f07805cffa8cfdcd2a5847d5fbcc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/4009db355c1f07805cffa8cfdcd2a5847d5fbcc9"}],"sha":"c7f8cf41f52cf35bad9e78ebaed36f6d1269615b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/c7f8cf41f52cf35bad9e78ebaed36f6d1269615b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/4009db355c1f07805cffa8cfdcd2a5847d5fbcc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:10:17Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:10:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tokenguard): token 会话有效性内核(aurora opt-in feature,防护三件套之「登录后」) (#51)\n\n从消费方(homeserver-deploy / homeserver)抽取已逐字重复的鉴权内核到框架层,消除两仓手工同步、\n必然漂移的复制品(tokendeny 曾两仓字节相同;homeserver#189 曾因漏改 renew → 全节点待授权 P0)。\n\n定位:aurora 防护三件套里的「登录后」——loginguard(登录前限流)/ tokenguard(登录后会话)/\ndoorman(请求级风险),三者平级、各自 feature/<name> 一个 feature、同一套「引擎给判定、动作留业务」\n哲学。本 PR 是三件套第一个,定样板。\n\n放 aurora/feature/tokenguard,对外只暴露 tokenguard.Guard(VerifySession / VerifySessionProxied /\nBindLoginIP / RevokeClaims / Revoke)+ 纯 scope 助手(SessionTags / ScopeOf / PublicFeatures)+\nNewTokenGuardFeature(denyTTL);实现全在 internal/{denylist,loginip,scope},Go 强制外部不可 import。\n\n装配:\n- opt-in feature,不进 bootstrap 默认集:鉴权服务显式 AddFeature(须 redis+jwt 之后)。纯 worker/\n  非鉴权服务不该被强加。\n- denyTTL 由调用方**构造时显式传**(不写死从 jwt 读 —— 不把\"最长 token 寿命==jwt refresh\"焊死;\n  某服务自签更长寿 token 直接传更大值即可)。通常传 jc.RefreshExpireOrDefault()。\n  它仅 Revoke(jti) 兜底用;RevokeClaims 永远按 claims.ExpiresAt 精确推。\n- Setup 任何失败(redis 未注入/denyTTL 非法)return error → aurora AddFeature log.Fatalf 启动即退,\n  绝不静默降级成全站 401。\n\n设计:fail-close 读 + fail-loud 写;吊销两半都做 errors.Join 合并上报;黑名单 TTL 覆盖 token 完整\n剩余寿命且不进调用签名;零客户端类型判断、无 enforceIP 标志参数;多服务(user/customer)纯靠配置。\n\n含全套单测与 README。消费仓 repoint 由后续 PR 处理。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a2a28276ac09c3c67758f1a9553fd9a518fbb1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/4a2a28276ac09c3c67758f1a9553fd9a518fbb1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/4009db355c1f07805cffa8cfdcd2a5847d5fbcc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a2a28276ac09c3c67758f1a9553fd9a518fbb1b\nparent fa498acdfea5d50e8bf18826ca21a8a6ffea918a\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790377817 -0400\ncommitter Gi