#50)\n\n一个 IP 是不是机房/托管网络,只看其 ASN 号在不在编译期内嵌的 bad-asn-list(MIT)清单里,\n不再做任何组织名关键词猜测。确定、可审计、可维护:判定 100% 由清单决定,漏判补录一个号即可,\n也不会因住宅运营商名字含 cloud/server 被误杀;法人名不含关键词的机房(如 AS20473=Vultr/Choopa)照样按号抓到。\n删掉 looksLikeHosting/hostingOrgKeywords 关键词启发式;isHostingASN(asn) 收口,asn==0 一律 false。\n代价:覆盖范围=清单范围,清单未收录的机房判 false,靠定期同步/补录扩覆盖(见 data README)。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtp8LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm10QAC7VIjnIKxB+R13UVXre/Qw7\n0HYl1qXnXCT4SjYTkO1ctYd4WtTQzADQGfWL3ezuSpLZeF7WC8EOfkVsKUYGozcP\nk02kybtCsEKb2gQ/HqKbwu1UepXLWk7a2UkdLB3N1zq9AhRNdNgVGRS0DisTpTrJ\nQam1uae3rDS2Aighv08YC/sPl+BtXhmtBsBnDJh7Pbmj55UGr0NM2+IYNs+GTtYV\nvQ1IblGrTkKEmNtyjCjNPhJsd14izJQCQkyrh6kK8g+S3B7+Kw4oAuh9MyGQsLxu\n9jEkWKNN6uT+pb7h1CJGFLmbfKbcd7n4Ff3QVORwao0QBbcgGKvTuc2BZsjyva5c\nPzsuN1gTGiU4CYn6dTJ3FFNr7yGwIiLv5nNxnxWFFpO4t/JRfDH8YGWRxOIXaUUB\nUvcaFYKfVfpZU6igiie+G7e9MSN7ZzXlWd1lVEV+fS40+elsywgeWwRL3zxKpSDS\nLx+jKH1D6fP8KQAUNGBdi6JoHTtyziaYk2Dai142q3MHKjyanl2zFoiAviS+6pRe\nyzn8LWiPgKx4G+dLzO4tuC61dlBPIDDvAynDdscK+If4deVp7J7DJsIkG8etcaP6\ngjUFLiSQQKfLMiAfSU5uFa6G5uVV4mhTTRnE/3eOBb2BjxKF4NxfGl1boX8xMZk4\nMVgqLN/F2cTvC2w5PeuG\n=Im0O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T16:19:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/