ail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(geoip): 可选 ASN 面(ASN/组织名/机房标记),识别机房/云/Tor 注册 (#49)\n\ngeo 库此前只到归属地(国家/省/市/ISP),无法区分「住宅宽带」与「机房/云/Tor 出口」。\n本 PR 加一个与归属地正交的 ASN 面,用来识别脚本/机器人这类「非终端用户网络」的来源。\n\n- Record 增加 ASN / ASNOrg / IsHosting 三个结论字段(与定位正交,仅启用时填)。\n- WithASN(source) 库层开关 + WithASNEnabled(bool) Feature 层开关,默认关、不加载、不查(不写死)。\n- 新增 DB-IP ASN 源:NewDBIPASNSource / EmbeddedDBIPASNSource / resolveASNSource,\n  与 DB-IP City 同套路(gz 内嵌、解压临时文件后 mmap、Close 删临时文件)。\n- 内嵌 DB-IP ASN Lite(CC-BY,schema 兼容 GeoLite2-ASN),随二进制交付、构建不联网。\n- IsHosting 由 ASNOrg 关键词启发式判定(云厂商/托管/VPS/Tor 出口用词);\n  刻意避开 backbone/telecom 等骨干/终端词,减少误判住宅。启发式非权威,关键词表可增删。\n- router.Lookup 对国内外 IP 一并查 ASN(国内云主机也算机房)。\n- Config 增加 GEOIP_ASN_PATH(仅 WithASNEnabled 时生效,空=内嵌)。\n- 补测试(内嵌 ASN 解析 + 开关/正交合并 + IsHosting 启发式)+ doc/sample/README。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea17cb4cd0f9ae280cb10e0974cfbc0a79bf265f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/ea17cb4cd0f9ae280cb10e0974cfbc0a79bf265f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/2430b19c0a7a854cc9d0aaaed4469283f213fc1e","verification":{"payload":"tree ea17cb4cd0f9ae280cb10e0974cfbc0a79bf265f\nparent 1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790171362 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790171362 -0400\n\nfeat(geoip): 可选 ASN 面(ASN/组织名/机房标记),识别机房/云/Tor 注册 (#49)\n\ngeo 库此前只到归属地(国家/省/市/ISP),无法区分「住宅宽带」与「机房/云/Tor 出口」。\n本 PR 加一个与归属地正交的 ASN 面,用来识别脚本/机器人这类「非终端用户网络」的来源。\n\n- Record 增加 ASN / ASNOrg / IsHosting 三个结论字段(与定位正交,仅启用时填)。\n- WithASN(source) 库层开关 + WithASNEnabled(bool) Feature 层开关,默认关、不加载、不查(不写死)。\n- 新增 DB-IP ASN 源:NewDBIPASNSource / EmbeddedDBIPASNSource / resolveASNSource,\n  与 DB-IP City 同套路(gz 内嵌、解压临时文件后 mmap、Close 删临时文件)。\n- 内嵌 DB-IP ASN Lite(CC-BY,schema 兼容 GeoLite2-ASN),随二进制交付、构建不联网。\n- IsHosting 由 ASNOrg 关键词启发式判定(云厂商/托管/VPS/Tor 出口用词);\n  刻意避开 backbone/telecom 等骨干/终端词,减少误判住宅。启发式非权威,关键词表可增删。\n- router.Lookup 对国内外 IP 一并查 ASN(国内云主机也算机房)。\n- Config 增加 GEOIP_ASN_PATH(仅 WithASNEnabled 时生效,空=内嵌)。\n- 补测试(内嵌 ASN 解析 + 开关/正交合并 + IsHosting 启发式)+ doc/sample/README。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs9jiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADhQQAA+M5DKR8AMwdJXqXpKO1aiT\nr2b9ZHBHiBBcKTSbc6eXGD5D2pSNMm0FLdEYVRyZzQwTX7KGcO8IULFgnCkUgRrD\nB89ztZkDWuq0kBL1AA+qV8gWXKLpls3r3HQFUPr0ZXPgxiTB3+AX/auJxt+Ak+eG\nd4bjQVppEM4Kgz6Oz2RSZSfwq/S80XhZGAqjWw2gGwH2SLxcSoR3+Y4pRy+Wvsaz\ndBolyjNpZAaqdhRgBARA/1rt3P9riNqzzmMpySEdhJheODSm9mTeOfpYWSzekPRU\nv0tqD15qOg63YQJiLGad2TXXIrmKEMjdbKTL5pjzOKfRZ4DMH2lzDnm9iMCsAEe3\nLihHxEvSj9FBSNsUDgUAI12AsMHBRNh02zgor1yzBkvoLvfeYNoJQEzinS4oZov/\nGnDdjcDqEsYTfa9eOzstnk5joK0RNfazd4s0Rn+nfCYNKCjI2AYN7ayePAar5Q4O\nB8fyjKBMsqLBXPqH83dObqUd/DpOAaAojL5+hFnY7mpAlCYodvqYvabNMbgHcHo2\nrKrHspfdXIeyE/fjqMrc6Mlqr7HSGDzI+7CS8jKXexUUA1W/0o0IH/dkMvEbY7LB\nudMjxFv9F/mSG6aK7UFdZaK5Zb0zHGrBZZYPvIaM0XZeFm8hBKv5MOzJSlfLKj8z\nK6PP22kIbUk4dcCqANBR\n=e6Gi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T13:49:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/2430b19c0a7a854cc9d0aaaed4469283f213fc1e","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKDI0MzBiMTljMGE3YTg1NGNjOWQwYWFhZWQ0NDY5MjgzZjIxM2ZjMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992","sha":"1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992"}],"sha":"2430b19c0a7a854cc9d0aaaed4469283f213fc1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/2430b19c0a7a854cc9d0aaaed4469283f213fc1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:38:20Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:38:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(geoip): IP→归属地本地离线解析 feature(双库内嵌自包含,可选中国兜底) (#48)\n\n新增 `feature/geoip`:把「IP → 归属地(国家/省/市/运营商)」的本地离线解析收口成\n一个 aurora feature,供下游(注册归因、会话归属地等)直接用。`Resolver.Lookup(ip) Record`,\n业务无需关心用哪个库。\n\n能力\n- 双源:国内 ip2region(中文省市+运营商)、国外 DB-IP City(英文省市);判 CN 走国内否则国外。\n- 可选中国兜底 WithChinaFallback(默认关):国内「有省无市」时,DB-IP 省一致才补参考市\n  (英文名→中文映射,标 Record.CityApprox=true)。DB-IP 对华城市偏粗,故省级闸门 + 标参考。\n- 优雅降级:任一库缺失/损坏 → 该源为空、不 panic、不阻断。隐私:IP 只查本地库,绝不外发。\n\n两库都内嵌(go:embed),feature 彻底自包含 —— 防上游闭源\n- 实体 gz 入版本控制 `feature/geoip/data/`(ip2region ~4MB、DB-IP ~57MB),构建/运行都读本地\n  文件,绝不 build 时联网下载。即便上游数据源将来下线,已入库的 gz 仍在,照常可用。\n- 内存策略随库大小:ip2region(~11MB)解压进内存 buffer 常驻;DB-IP(~121MB)解压到临时文件\n  再 mmap(冷内存、按需分页),Close 时关 reader + 删临时文件(不泄漏)。\n- env 仅用于外挂覆盖内嵌库:GEOIP_IP2REGION_PATH / GEOIP_DBIP_PATH(便于线下更新)。\n\n配套\n- aurora Feature 封装:NewFeature(opts...) → Setup 里 ProvideAs 一个 Resolver、Close 释放资源。\n- sample/geoip:零配置 go run 就打印国内外 IP 归属地的可跑示例 + README。\n- doc/features/geoip.md:用法/配置/CI-CD(两库内嵌零负担)/升级(A 换内嵌 gz、B env 外挂)/资源内存/隐私。\n- 单测:fakeSource 钉逻辑 + 内嵌国内/国外真查用例 + Close 清临时文件校验。\n\n依赖:oschwald/maxminddb-golang、lionsoul2014/ip2region/binding/golang(与下游对齐),已同步 vendor。","tree":{"sha":"5a33ee4dcdbcd67ca38bd51eee17b7f554467d6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/5a33ee4dcdbcd67ca38bd51eee17b7f554467d6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/1a230f072515bfa006f405bcc55ea097523fd992","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a33ee4dcdbcd67ca38bd51eee17b7f554467d6f\nparent 053db5168a686a810abd9491725afdf89947e544\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1790138300 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790138300 -0400\n\nfeat(geoip): IP→归属地本地离线解析 feature(双库内嵌自包含,可选中国兜底) (#48)\n\n新增 `feature/geoip`:把「IP → 归属地(国家/省/市/运营商)」的本地离线解析收口成\n一个 aurora feature,供下游(注册归因、会话归属地等)直接用。`Resolver.Lookup(ip) Record`,\n业务无需关心用哪个库。\n\n能力\n- 双源:国内 ip2region(中文省市+运营商)、国外 DB-IP City(英文省市);判 CN 走国内否则国外。\n- 可选中国兜底 WithChinaFallback(默认关):国内「有省无市」时,DB-IP 省一致才补参考市\n  (英文名→中文映射,标 Record.CityApprox=true)。DB-IP 对华城市偏粗,故省级闸门 + 标参考。\n- 优雅降级:任一库缺失/损坏 → 该源为空、不 panic、不阻断。隐私:IP 只查本地库,绝不外发。\n\n两库都内嵌(go:embed),feature 彻底自包含 —— 防上游闭源\n- 实体 gz 入版本控制 `feature/geoip/data/`(ip2region ~4MB、DB-IP ~57MB),构建/运行都读本地\n  文件,绝不 build 时联网下载。即便上游数据源将来下线,已入库的 gz 仍在,照常可用。\n- 内存策略随库大小:ip2region(~11MB)解压进内存 buffer 常驻;DB-IP(~121MB)解压到临时文件\n  再 mmap(冷内存、按需分页),Close 时关 reader + 删临时文件(不泄漏)。\n- env 仅用于外挂覆盖内嵌库:GEOIP_IP2REGION_PATH / GEOIP_DBIP_PATH(便于线下更新)。\n\n配套\n- aurora Feature 封装:NewFeature(opts...) → Setup 里 ProvideAs 一个 Resolver、Close 释放资源。\n- sample/geoip:零配置 go run 就打印国内外 IP 归属地的可跑示例 + README。\n- doc/features/geoip.md:用法/配置/CI-CD(两库内嵌零负担)/升级(A 换内嵌 gz、B env 外挂)/资源内存/隐私。\n- 单测:fakeSource 钉逻辑 + 内嵌国内/国外真查用例 + Close 清临时文件校验。\n\n依赖:oschwald/maxminddb-golang、lionsoul2014/ip2region/binding/golang(与下游对齐),已同步 vendor。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs1e8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARZ4QAD+KbJys4dkSrUB7g1s3Sq2D\nIVJa5tLchnhBL/edq0qEii9CFXetfMsnjLgFELr+um7c07NCmN+4l9IxeGzPcdDz\ncPNLb51VIOjshyZIcMsQAIT6YNHAD+M3SDkD3PD8064swJAsfft8jrJWTCIDw2lS\nAyJjvNQgg2AKtkBXaGC/ABoIyC9zraiKpiUfKv9Qk7+vaiI7I4omU+onajQ+Ace7\n2XLT9S8EXJ5XUkJ3S+XnoPFJFLQvcW/pMfoat6mLxcodPBfmvVi0A9ErdG/Woi+A\nYMRnPsetqiANCT7oQwVRtZzLvzwqf4QHpDNevMppKwI+ZIg223n3wAaOinxRVZNr\niki6wusHOOFq4hyExZBLYbaemq/C9/5sAZ9mR0p5/LyBJib45YvzS+YpGpQW2dtk\nSDN/F1glpvF3aVaFI4WqVILhsEdkXyQ18aGvIK/n9ruPe65/Qwqgy5ettuqmNsO1\ndsHYU2xzX430h3E2loGhwg8dee0SM7kn+JMX6kZMag5NZthZdbKrwlKol7vDke8m\n/yY+VquUo+5oRB+n5CClayabWgp9Tboa0fXIPz7WhdrvGkFbTqyjPVgCx9SiYJKM\nYdR7hEHHzfc7M0WMvCRrcoyY8tWM1bT0+VoG2C1IDwDI57Giio8sxPSdUWeeZwZi\nOexCTzAAMlkSYhgy/MPr\n=nKnn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T04:38:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github