293b00b07d7f168ddcf1d4997da8e3c5","sha":"db1c06ae293b00b07d7f168ddcf1d4997da8e3c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/db1c06ae293b00b07d7f168ddcf1d4997da8e3c5"}],"sha":"053db5168a686a810abd9491725afdf89947e544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/053db5168a686a810abd9491725afdf89947e544"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/db1c06ae293b00b07d7f168ddcf1d4997da8e3c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:33:49Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T03:33:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(jwt): 撤销检查 fail-closed——Redis 报错时拒绝 token,不再吞错放行 (#46)\n\nValidateToken / ValidateRefreshToken 原用 `if ok, _ := f.isBlacklisted(...)` 吞掉\n黑名单查询的错误:Redis 一旦报错(不止宕机——任何瞬时超时/连接抖动),已登出/已吊销\n但未过期的 token 就被当作''未拉黑''放行。且这是**每请求**的,攻击者可重试撞上抖动窗口;\n上层即便叠了 token-IP 绑定也是**另一次独立** Redis 调用,并不兜底这个洞。登出/吊销是\n承重安全控制,不该被一次 Redis 抖动绕过。\n\n改为 fail-closed:isBlacklisted 返回 err 时,ValidateToken/ValidateRefreshToken 直接\n拒(返回错误),而非放行。与 token-IP 绑定既有的 fail-close 语义一致。\n\n补测试:撤销存储报错→拒(access+refresh)、未拉黑→过、已拉黑→拒(含最小 RedisService fake)。","tree":{"sha":"089cbef5c4823e0e37658f2eb0e2de93b15915e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/089cbef5c4823e0e37658f2eb0e2de93b15915e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/db1c06ae293b00b07d7f168ddcf1d4997da8e3c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 089cbef5c4823e0e37658f2eb0e2de93b15915e8\nparent 9961b204b6b134374e47952191ae42aa11cb85c7\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1786851229 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786851229 +0800\n\nfix(jwt): 撤销检查 fail-closed——Redis 报错时拒绝 token,不再吞错放行 (#46)\n\nValidateToken / ValidateRefreshToken 原用 `if ok, _ := f.isBlacklisted(...)` 吞掉\n黑名单查询的错误:Redis 一旦报错(不止宕机——任何瞬时超时/连接抖动),已登出/已吊销\n但未过期的 token 就被当作''未拉黑''放行。且这是**每请求**的,攻击者可重试撞上抖动窗口;\n上层即便叠了 token-IP 绑定也是**另一次独立** Redis 调用,并不兜底这个洞。登出/吊销是\n承重安全控制,不该被一次 Redis 抖动绕过。\n\n改为 fail-closed:isBlacklisted 返回 err 时,ValidateToken/ValidateRefreshToken 直接\n拒(返回错误),而非放行。与 token-IP 绑定既有的 fail-close 语义一致。\n\n补测试:撤销存储报错→拒(access+refresh)、未拉黑→过、已拉黑→拒(含最小 RedisService fake)。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgS+dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASd8QACoSr3v6JHeYYQaYyB3TlmWp\nCFm88x8vpXB+Cqmzq9BhckY/bNK6IcV+Q2+kYPDzmsY1ewnoxIvU3e/MYdxRf4DO\nsSMGE29xYebg8LZLhkTDY22a/w623f2LqjBxDxOKp++YcCvlgyoPPvo6VbflPCyg\nE7CdO4Il6cVSzrtzWUJo0KdcdKbmuK5RiKkuEDGb/J0Op+egW7y6IQK0eSkGx9jj\nOBFGcTLdsFcUQXfhA/0Cy6fmd/giTqoNeP6IoPbYoaEvHSqMnUw48Yi/+vCuZZvR\nVmoUzjseRQvRIkwGMFq7Mb3/FRER8t9evBV8D7/Q7UMrZ2pVFAoSph4kcUoCiBsA\n7OXvLi92FbFLuuAkm17bB58J9HRDbsLHwnwz/+hf0i9bfFpLzsot4mSg3AfQw6y/\n0mgZivljQH7CdpZtDCidjyPY9MGmMULnKsIZqphCP40T/dgox6na+iHQagdJzlv2\n5Npgml+s6z5dnyKNgPzh6vnNFd/DxQfPJ8SCIQT9WCKwHexn4mPd79v99EbVfTF9\nuW8mFZjQizKmgUqWk2sB8+3IkOWcpHGNUbP6/hO59aMM84tr28P0KNepJST2yvX7\nJ9FWY1edf+uGEt620k8Tm9Z5ax8BDtCYbymsGEzF6ho0iurQkwilwAnU2YjFvo0x\n4crj9drXE3dQdLZjUZMP\n=L+fD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE---