ub.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/9961b204b6b134374e47952191ae42aa11cb85c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:57:23Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T06:57:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(jwt): 给令牌加 token_type,区分 access/refresh,堵住 refresh 当 access 用 (#45)\n\naccess 与 refresh 令牌同密钥、同 Claims 结构,却没有类型标记 —— 于是 refresh 令牌能通过\nValidateToken 的校验、被当成 access 去调业务接口。而\"退出登录 / 踢设备 / 盗号重用吊链\"的吊销\n恰恰挂在 refresh 专属的黑名单(RedisKeyBlackRefreshTokenPrefix)或 RT 集上,业务侧只查 access\n黑名单,于是这些\"让某次登录立刻失效\"的机制全被绕过(只要对方手里还攥着长寿命 refresh)。\n(改密/封号按 userID+iat 纪元记,不看令牌类型,不受影响。)\n\n修法:Claims 加 TokenType(access/refresh);签发时分别写入;ValidateToken 只认 access、\nValidateRefreshToken 只认 refresh。旧令牌无此字段 → 按\"非对应类型\"拒(强制重登,无灰度)。\n\nfeature 包 build & test 通过。","tree":{"sha":"3a20030189a27f9abe74c969b6545504e7b16f8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/3a20030189a27f9abe74c969b6545504e7b16f8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/9961b204b6b134374e47952191ae42aa11cb85c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a20030189a27f9abe74c969b6545504e7b16f8a\nparent 082e90950a561a1d2704a697bee546f0eca812b2\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1786777043 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786777043 +0800\n\nfix(jwt): 给令牌加 token_type,区分 access/refresh,堵住 refresh 当 access 用 (#45)\n\naccess 与 refresh 令牌同密钥、同 Claims 结构,却没有类型标记 —— 于是 refresh 令牌能通过\nValidateToken 的校验、被当成 access 去调业务接口。而\"退出登录 / 踢设备 / 盗号重用吊链\"的吊销\n恰恰挂在 refresh 专属的黑名单(RedisKeyBlackRefreshTokenPrefix)或 RT 集上,业务侧只查 access\n黑名单,于是这些\"让某次登录立刻失效\"的机制全被绕过(只要对方手里还攥着长寿命 refresh)。\n(改密/封号按 userID+iat 纪元记,不看令牌类型,不受影响。)\n\n修法:Claims 加 TokenType(access/refresh);签发时分别写入;ValidateToken 只认 access、\nValidateRefreshToken 只认 refresh。旧令牌无此字段 → 按\"非对应类型\"拒(强制重登,无灰度)。\n\nfeature 包 build & test 通过。","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgA3TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUBEQADrR1mHOYljyO1Wg4CR5pcww\ncg5X1k0m1tK+7YmjZIsaf/xmanytMfKFXcBRMCOhGiomE5JOfb5sG3F+hqH60NqH\nb0fVUuHT07aOaX7neRlPz1EMcRMDuFwZ+uyydV9GGMxKhIdTCCEl5qqljr9YdCMm\nFtXTNoySFRsKz05100kPdPcT9BIcAAeo7Aya2LM2sZri4tGwi2aQRgOk1++VoYzu\nJ21ZraZI/WD535/j29/UPa3TNg3B0nufGMkaME0ttVdoFwqDj116WOGA/IV4cDmi\n7JASJzv7nuaHtneCcwepJKQdUKe/DxoY6r+p2yUpXZ0+/i0m/SBx8oZ5m7w/76Jh\nFVxUTYqqh2A9NGs/Rm3Nkv/JkP3ldzylXjQJq6O/k/gZIbCNPWkdDKFrqR5YeHCs\no0wYTllitCUWfpT9GAPfbS5RCnoxsBTB9dODVNtpaYGheB0TR3YhK+xVdFqmnfhK\nvREBd+fCdHq6qLFvM34WvUFbfriX4Dx7gBiTmx2zKeygpVS9Qzz6I0+UC6ZDpz5K\njr1JQdpt76OvA3hKK7Fv+FKN46xNx0aOrzbFoJU/IMXhVu4wuZHygSS6wlnfb/nr\nB6YUiitqiCvsNKsNAefqqGhLbRn9TJlXmbrQNqN4gGI62Heiqs5Sf6tQ9euJjJEy\ndLhQtoD+I0sLwFabgABW\n=vlRu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-15T06:57:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_