09:31:32Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T09:31:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mail): configurable SMTP transport encryption (auto/none/starttls/ssl) (#44)\n\nAdd WithEncryption(Encryption) SMTP option so callers can force the transport\nsecurity mode instead of relying solely on gomail''s port-based defaults.\n\n- EncryptionAuto (\"\", the zero value): unchanged behaviour — SSL iff port==465,\n  else opportunistic STARTTLS with plaintext fallback. Existing callers unaffected.\n- EncryptionNone: plaintext, STARTTLS disabled (for servers with no encryption).\n- EncryptionStartTLS: mandatory STARTTLS.\n- EncryptionSSL: implicit TLS on connect, regardless of port.\n\nApplied to the gomail dialer in Send(). Covered by TestWithEncryption.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00e8c703c54f9336e82ebd6c48574efa87177a59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/00e8c703c54f9336e82ebd6c48574efa87177a59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/082e90950a561a1d2704a697bee546f0eca812b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 00e8c703c54f9336e82ebd6c48574efa87177a59\nparent f40c582ec67ccc36c27a1b6b68b3c1b52c65b76a\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1786613492 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786613492 +0800\n\nfeat(mail): configurable SMTP transport encryption (auto/none/starttls/ssl) (#44)\n\nAdd WithEncryption(Encryption) SMTP option so callers can force the transport\nsecurity mode instead of relying solely on gomail''s port-based defaults.\n\n- EncryptionAuto (\"\", the zero value): unchanged behaviour — SSL iff port==465,\n  else opportunistic STARTTLS with plaintext fallback. Existing callers unaffected.\n- EncryptionNone: plaintext, STARTTLS disabled (for servers with no encryption).\n- EncryptionStartTLS: mandatory STARTTLS.\n- EncryptionSSL: implicit TLS on connect, 