Subscribe (returns a payload\nchannel + idempotent close func; releases the connection on close or ctx cancel) to\nthe RedisService abstraction, so services can do event-driven pub/sub (e.g. config\ncache invalidation) without opening a raw go-redis client.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77dcf0aca9e969302fa82b064a77275880601551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/77dcf0aca9e969302fa82b064a77275880601551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/f40c582ec67ccc36c27a1b6b68b3c1b52c65b76a","verification":{"payload":"tree 77dcf0aca9e969302fa82b064a77275880601551\nparent 88da1fb809537700243359d39707430be2ffcdae\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1786522058 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786522058 +0800\n\nfeat(redis): add Publish/Subscribe to RedisService (#43)\n\nAdds fire-and-forget Publish and an auto-reconnecting Subscribe (returns a payload\nchannel + idempotent close func; releases the connection on close or ctx cancel) to\nthe RedisService abstraction, so services can do event-driven pub/sub (e.g. config\ncache invalidation) without opening a raw go-redis client.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfCnKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM20QAB8aYobhg1YwEMr/S2YdNyzc\ntnvJVnWyjvBGzsBBA7qAlMc7TN5uI3kSmiPj9pmAhCPGGEdivGRjDpXsxUxmly0z\nKWaOC1gRoTiRdkzr/D2pI4AU10pXg4ziYOKiyZgAI97MF+DmqsBLVeIJJlULyjqb\nwUoN+fYnSxz6lpD7HXPPW7cuSrIbweyargGlN6VNLZ9/GGl1fAcamcA274RP0oy/\nvBB1aj0hqBovh2jAxEZr6BbdxOkRAtkrOCbDTHDBG9iSwwA/jo97EtvLirlBdUIe\nKQU+qptaeAjQ/iP59SMGjqtew5ZNAe4nHxgT9BjaBNA25k/w0k0wzFYg7tG3NmHN\ndmkvV1Z83cGyNW1vHlyfK5BHnDNFepgJ+TWsMZpFpjr3wCPRBc5HWj4R1tI3pcle\nUy6Q4obDSbR4BItNCXGVlPQrMIBQ0AgZF6Xz/PZIincLlDU5cBo2eDMonveVWjbS\nCJV2V6c+E+OPvk5ct/CCIknAUqMbeEUA2JZnF4OTSAEWNdFCp7Jc/FJ7Ucm/aUxf\njLzY6tS78fINmBE2q4EAioKQ2JBkftsvPdBa9kYbLFnK7i9tW+R0lzZugchplSc