rs/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/341d226ac5f8a6acc7f320e358473fac61c32430/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T08:32:14Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T08:32:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(mail): rewrite for the new feature/mail package (#41)\n\nPR #40 replaced the mail feature with a provider-agnostic feature/mail package (Mailer + SMTP\nwith pluggable auth incl. XOAUTH2, context-aware); the old env-based EmailService /\nNewMailFeature / MailConfig were removed. Sweep ALL docs so nothing still describes mail as an\nenv-registered Feature:\n\n- doc/features/mail.md: rewritten for the new API (Message, NewSMTP + options,\n  BasicAuth/NoAuth/XOAuth2, how to add a provider/auth) + a migration table.\n- doc/README.md: drop 邮件 from the core-Feature list; rewrite the mail feature-table row\n  (no longer a Feature / no env); drop the stale \"MAIL_* 全强制必填\" improvement note.\n- doc/architecture.md: drop mail from the intro Feature list, the NewMailFeature() line in the\n  default-app example, and the AddFeature(mail) node in the startup sequence diagram.\n- sample/full_showcase/.env: drop the MAIL_SMTP_* block, point to constructing a mailer in code.","tree":{"sha":"014267edf99fa61a5d3217fe0aca1e904d1b204d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/014267edf99fa61a5d3217fe0aca1e904d1b204d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/341d226ac5f8a6acc7f320e358473fac61c32430","verification":{"payload":"tree 014267edf99fa61a5d3217fe0aca1e904d1b204d\nparent f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a\nauthor shyandsy <sh