":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/341d226ac5f8a6acc7f320e358473fac61c32430","node_id":"C_kwDOQd9dI9oAKDM0MWQyMjZhYzVmOGE2YWNjN2YzMjBlMzU4NDczZmFjNjFjMzI0MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy/aurora/commit/f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a","sha":"f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a"}],"sha":"341d226ac5f8a6acc7f320e358473fac61c32430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/341d226ac5f8a6acc7f320e358473fac61c32430"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5271457?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyandsy","id":5271457,"login":"shyandsy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzE0NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyandsy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/commits/f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T07:29:07Z","email":"shyandsy@gmail.com","name":"shyandsy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T07:29:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mail): provider-agnostic mail package (functional options, open SMTP auth, ctx-aware) (#40)\n\nfeature/mail — an extensible email package. Consumers depend only on Mailer.Send(ctx, Message)\nand construct the concrete Mailer with their own config source (env / DB / ad-hoc).\n\nDesign (by dimension):\n  mailer.go — Message (Text/HTML) + Mailer interface + validation.\n  auth.go   — OPEN, pluggable auth: SMTPAuth.Apply(ctx, SMTPDialer). External code can add a\n              mechanism by implementing SMTPAuth against the SMTPDialer abstraction (SetBasic /\n              SetMechanism) + net/smtp — no dependency on the concrete SMTP library. Built-ins:\n              BasicAuth, NoAuth, XOAuth2 (real SASL XOAUTH2 with a per-send TokenSource).\n  smtp.go   — NewSMTP(host, port, ...SMTPOption): WithFrom / WithAuth / WithTimeout. Send is\n              context-aware (DialAndSend runs in a goroutine; ctx cancels the wait, dial bounded\n              by timeout). buildMessage split out for unit tests; errors if From is unresolved.\n\nDimensions: Content (text/html/both -> multipart/alternative); Auth (open SMTPAuth via options);\nProvider (each is a Mailer from its own constructor — Aliyun/SES/... as further impls, e.g.\nfeature/mail/aliyun, so their SDK deps never bloat the core); Consumer sees only Mailer.\n\nbootstrap no longer auto-registers a mail feature. Intentionally not backward compatible\n(aurora is vendored + pinned per project). Full unit tests incl. XOAUTH2 SASL, From fallback/\nerror, content selection, and context-cancellation.","tree":{"sha":"e8bb185e0f790af856ddf04da0f746b39e2cca9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/trees/e8bb185e0f790af856ddf04da0f746b39e2cca9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyandsy/aurora/git/commits/f6540445b241742c12fdaaccd0c257614523e47a","verification":{"payload":"tree e8bb185e0f790af856ddf04da0f746b39e2cca9f\nparent 8754530350648105f6109ba3b36d2292cdeda99f\nauthor shyandsy <shyandsy@gmail.com> 1786433347 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786433347 +0800\n\nfeat(mail): provider-agnostic mail package (functional options, open SMTP auth, ctx-aware) (#40)\n\nfeature/mail — an extensible email package. Consumers depend only on Mailer.Send(ctx, Message)\nand construct the concrete Mailer with their own config source (env / DB / ad-hoc).\n\nDesign (by dimension):\n  mailer.go — Message (Text/HTML) + Mailer interface + validation.\n  auth.go   — OPEN, pluggable auth: SMTPAuth.Apply(ctx, SMTPDialer). External code can add a\n              mechanism by implementing SMTPAuth against the SMTPDialer abstraction (SetBasic /\n              SetMechanism) + net/smtp — no dependency on the concrete SMTP library. Built-ins:\n              BasicAuth, NoAuth, XOAuth2 (real SASL XOAUTH2 with a per-send TokenSource).\n  smtp.go   — NewSMTP(host, port, ...SMTPOption): WithFrom / WithAuth / WithTimeout. Send is\n              context-aware (DialAndSend runs in a goroutine; ctx cancels the wait, dial bounded\n              by timeout). buildMessage split out for unit tests; errors if From is unresolved.\n\nDimensions: Content (text/html/both -> multipart/alternative); Auth (open SMTPAuth via options);\nProvider (each is a Mailer from its own constructor — Aliyun/SES/... as further impls, e.g.\nfeature/mail/aliyun, so their SDK deps never bloat the core); Consumer sees only Mailer.\n\nbootstrap no longer auto-registers a mail feature. Intentionally not backward compatible\n(aurora is vendored + pinned per project). Full unit tests incl. XOAUTH2 SASL, From fallback/\nerror, content selection, and context-cancellation.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqes9DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACMoQABaHHdPwQXo3Hd6Hh+1IX+Za\nqRSpk1m6ufFcBypmPqC0Yvob71BTKb2aYNaXqrxBWbpQKV4HiiRFSBSQfWOHHEUl\n3iLRYLC5Zt6VlPM6SY3KGpS84qVZ+IcD0Z+qUyYWyF2iNrWQJg0jsbs0DOIaAST6\nnB0S9mF00dq7tztwnTR9yarhfJyy2EgpGjjmxBo7tQIB14KKF6SGsFJJUzLok8lD\n6pkNsmy5dseEEAJ2xPJTJwrm5ko3v3p7qMVzCYZzAbtZw+1908iDedBtZkUu84AY\n9QvZmKWgyGrsm6hU4RUcZsUE1iffXyuY1fM215dnRPG6qpJv0dJQbZ1rp0SrxI7E\nPIaZTerC+LlYuZsN+Xi7XU/IVpZM66lOoOxyjzjOGAS7JOM9J/+iMdNt7aEvx6AA\n0MYRZW9TIkkv084+/XsmkIl8/Ch7MzM6EgMx9n+NpwfGm3pyrF+J+eO5iiu5hzCA\nV/aa+hA1sOx6HCnf28k9NCRywGgrIQJTT8SbFoRJwtS/NBoFprPMvhQYselDC3Mq\nzqNvVMHI6QapmH7YzIlWUEbY3l5l6Gy6aBO4CrRaR97x8V0pe+7Gs8BiTQM9C9Lo\n8HD1vofxUUwPyRAJLrbGIgNzVbdTeOiv8gLiHxyxL/GQMEaP1HON+NIVU/02IpVc\nf3qe8hmJ+aKa1YLYln8l\n=vLkH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-11T07:29:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us