ser_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/911ea587f5e866c574ef83e5635af768ae86b2ac","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKDkxMWVhNTg3ZjVlODY2YzU3NGVmODNlNTYzNWFmNzY4YWU4NmIyYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498","sha":"69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498"}],"sha":"911ea587f5e866c574ef83e5635af768ae86b2ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/911ea587f5e866c574ef83e5635af768ae86b2ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T20:34:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T20:34:51Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**chore: update Docker compose ports and archive workflows**\n\n- **Docker Compose Adjustments:**\n  - Updated backend ports from `8080:8080` to `3000:3000` and frontend ports from `3000:3000` to `8080:8080` for consistent alignment with runtime expectations and local development flow.\n  - Adjusted `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` environment variable to match port changes (`http://localhost:3000/api` in frontend).\n\n- **CI/CD Workflow Simplification:**\n  - **Archival:**\n    - Archived several outdated workflows (`frontend-deploy.yml`, `ci.yml`, `backend-deploy.yml`, `game-deploy.yml`).\n    - Replaced triggered actions with `workflow_dispatch` to allow manual runs if necessary.\n    - Clarified archival status with inline documentation and renamed workflows (e.g., `(Archived) Deploy Frontend to Firebase Hosting`).\n    - Disabled archived jobs explicitly using `if: ${{ false }}` to prevent accidental execution.\n  - **Enhancements:**\n    - Updated `.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml`:\n      - Added a step to compute SSH deployment readiness (`sshflags`) to streamline conditional logic for production deploys.\n\nThese updates consolidate workflows for better maintainability and ensure clarity during CI/CD execution while aligning development and runtime configurations.","tree":{"sha":"edaf92001b8b243607b607b85a79f0ca484bf621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/edaf92001b8b243607b607b85a79f0ca484bf621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKDY5ZmIxNmFjODVjYjc2MDEzZmU0NTEwNTY0NTMxMmVjZGVkNDg0OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4","sha":"3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4"}],"sha":"69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/69fb16ac85cb76013fe45105645312ecded48498"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T20:10:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T20:10:03Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"**chore(backend): enhance Maven dependency management, profiles, and tooling updates**\n\n- **Dependency Management:**\n  - Centralized dependency alignment using `dependencyManagement` to enforce consistent versions and avoid vulnerabilities.\n  - Integrated `com.google.cloud:libraries-bom` for managing transitive dependencies of Google Cloud libraries.\n  - Pinned critical dependencies explicitly to reduce version conflicts (`protobuf-java`, `guava`, `google-http-client`, etc.).\n\n- **Version Updates:**\n  - Updated numerous library versions for performance, compatibility, and security, including:\n    - `google-cloud-secretmanager` from 2.80.0 to 2.43.0.\n    - `resilience4j` from 2.2.0 to 2.3.0.\n    - `logstash-logback-encoder` from 7.3 to 7.4.\n    - `graphql-java-extended-scalars` from 21.0 to 22.0.\n    - `firebase-admin` from 9.2.0 to 9.3.0.\n    - `commons-codec` from 1.16.0 to 1.17.1.\n  - Upgraded project parent `spring-boot-starter-parent` from 3.4.3 to 3.4.7.\n\n- **Profiles and Optional Configurations:**\n  - Added a `dev` profile with H2 database setup for local development to simplify runtime and reduce Postgres reliance.\n  - Introduced an `owasp` profile for optional OWASP dependency checks.\n\n- **Tooling Enhancements:**\n  - Integrated `maven-enforcer-plugin` with rules for dependency convergence, Maven version, and Java version enforcement.\n  - Enhanced Maven configuration for reproducible builds and improved visibility of configuration discrepancies.\n\n- **Frontend and General Changes:**\n  - Updated `dev` script in frontend `package.json` to remove dynamic port resolution, explicitly binding to `8080`.\n  - Adjusted GitHub CI/CD workflow Maven test command to include `-U` for updated snapshots.\n  - Fixed `next-env.d.ts` path for correct route type resolution in Next.js.\n\n- **New Files:**\n  - Added `application-dev.yml` for Spring Boot dev profile configuration, improving debug settings and H2 runtime setup.\n\nThese changes improve dependency consistency, simplify local development, and modernize tooling for better maintainability and security.","tree":{"sha":"f920bd100b2798f4177697e1fe80736ef4f7e3d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/f920bd100b2798f4177697e1fe80736ef4f7e3d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/3f211363fbec604f1f4bf06a4a0ad990104286b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKDNmMjExMzYzZmJlYzYwNGYxZjRiZjA2YTRhMGFkOTkwMTA