wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/95f228cc0efa25ab5d4b1c49334adf6a4863236e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:39:06Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:39:06Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"### chore: cleanup ESLint config, enhance CI/CD, and update Next.js config\n\n- **ESLint Cleanup:**\n  - Removed Tailwind CSS-specific plugin configuration from `eslint.config.mjs` as it is no longer needed in the current setup.\n  - Simplifies ESLint configuration for maintainability.\n\n- **CI/CD Enhancements:**\n  - Introduced conditional environment flag checks (`hubflags`, `gcpflags`) in workflows to handle missing secrets or variables gracefully, avoiding redundant runs.\n  - Refactored Docker Hub login, Buildx setup, image builds, and deployments in `ci-cd.yml` to use conditional steps based on these environment flags.\n  - Enhanced Cloud Run deployment logic to verify GCP secrets (`GCP_PROJECT_ID`, `GCP_REGION`, `GCP_SA_KEY`) before executing deploy steps.\n  - Ensured proper conditional handling for production deployments based on `main` branch and configured secrets.\n\n- **Next.js Configuration Update:**\n  - Replaced `images.domains` with `remotePatterns` in `next.config.js` and `next.config.ts`, aligning with deprecations in Next.js 16.\n  - Updated image configurations to streamline and future-proof assets loading across multiple domains.\n\nThese updates improve configuration clarity, CI/CD pipeline resilience, and ensure compatibility with recent framework updates.","tree":{"sha":"ec659f8dbfabbc501fc11da5f7ab4fe11e7e2287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/ec659f8dbfabbc501fc11da5f7ab4fe11e7e2287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/95f228cc0efa25ab5d4b1c49334adf6a4863236e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/95f228cc0efa25ab5d4b1c49334adf6a4863236e","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKDk1ZjIyOGNjMGVmYTI1YWI1ZDRiMWM0OTMzNGFkZjZhNDg2MzIzNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/33ecf000110a7e0c36e4131029e348bda3aac64c","sha":"33ecf000110a7e0c36e4131029e348bda3aac64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/33ecf000110a7e0c36e4131029e348bda3aac64c"}],"sha":"95f228cc0efa25ab5d4b1c49334adf6a4863236e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/95f228cc0efa25ab5d4b1c49334adf6a4863236e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/33ecf000110a7e0c36e4131029e348bda3aac64c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T15:51:41Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T15:51:41Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"### chore: simplify setup, enhance runtime resilience, improve docs\n\n- **Dependency & Lockfile Updates:**\n  - Removed `bun.lockb` from `.dockerignore` for deterministic builds.\n  - Retained lockfiles (`bun.lockb`, `package-lock.json`, etc.) to improve caching and ensure reproducibility.\n\n- **Frontend Enhancements:**\n  - Updated `package.json` scripts:\n    - `dev` and `start` commands now respect dynamic ports via `${PORT:-8080}`; binds to `0.0.0.0` in `start` for Cloud Run compatibility.\n  - Enhanced `next.config.*`:\n    - Introduced standalone output mode based on `NEXT_STANDALONE` for optimized Docker builds.\n    - Added `assetPrefix: ''/''` to fix asset loading issues on nested routes.\n    - Extended `transpilePackages` to ensure smooth monorepo builds with workspace dependencies.\n    - Improved proxy rewrite handling via `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.\n  - Added a robust launcher (`frontend/docker/run.sh`):\n    - Prioritizes standalone server entry.\n    - Falls back to `next start` if no standalone entry found.\n\n- **Backend Adjustments:**\n  - Changed Dockerfile `EXPOSE` port to `3000` for consistency with Spring Boot defaults and Cloud Run health checks.\n\n- **Docs Overhaul:**\n  - Simplified README:\n    - Replaced legacy instructions with streamlined monorepo setup and Cloud Run deployment steps.\n    - Documented monorepo-aware Docker builds and runtime fallback strategy for frontend.\n    - Added multi-stage game publishing strategies, from static bundling to runtime plugin systems.\n    - Clearly explained recent production resilience changes, including health-check-friendly configs.\n\nThese adjustments reduce developer friction, ensure builds are reproducible, and improve deployment stability, particularly in Cloud Run environments.","tree":{"sha":"aa305582996a2f99e660f6a9f6ec343d7c1d6545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/aa305582996a2f99e660f6a9f6ec343d7c1d6545"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/33ecf000110a7e0c36e4131029e348bda3aac64c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://