43adbc9b9d125","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKDJiYmNhOGM1OTMwMzU1OTQ5NDA1YjE3ZTI4MzQzYWRiYzliOWQxMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30","sha":"d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30"}],"sha":"2bbca8c5930355949405b17e28343adbc9b9d125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/2bbca8c5930355949405b17e28343adbc9b9d125"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T16:23:07Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T16:23:07Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"feat: integrate GCP Cloud Run, Cloud SQL, and feature enhancements\n\n- **Backend Enhancements:**\n  - Removed `FeaturesController` and integrated its functionality into the improved `FeatureController` to consolidate feature flag management.\n  - Extended `FeatureController` to support environment-driven feature flags alongside service-backed flags for enhanced flexibility in toggling.\n  - Introduced `getBool` and `putIfAbsent` utility methods to ensure clean merging of configuration sources.\n  - Added `application-cloud.yml` for Cloud SQL configuration and production-oriented settings.\n\n- **CI/CD Updates:**\n  - Extended GitHub Actions workflow to support GCP Artifact Registry and Cloud Run deployments.\n  - Introduced conditional `deploy-cloudrun` job for deploying backend and frontend services to Cloud Run on `main` branch pushes.\n  - Added Docker configuration changes to enable Image Push to Artifact Registry.\n  - Configured deployment with Cloud SQL connectivity and secrets managed via GCP Secret Manager.\n\n- **Docker Enhancements:**\n  - Refactored `backend/Dockerfile` to enable multi-stage builds and reduce image size.\n  - Added Cloud SQL Proxy installation and setup steps to support private database connections.\n  - Leveraged a `startup.sh` script to dynamically configure application environment variables and manage Cloud SQL Proxy lifecycle.\n\n- **Configuration Additions:**\n  - Updated `.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml` to include GCP-specific variables such as `GCP_PROJECT_ID`, `GCP_REGION`, and `GCP_INSTANCE_CONNECTION_NAME`.\n  - Added comprehensive `.dockerignore` for backend and frontend to optimize Docker build contexts and prevent unnecessary file inclusion.\n  - Enhanced logback configuration with conditional Logstash appender enabling for better debugging in production.\n\n- **Documentation Updates:**\n  - Expanded README with detailed instructions for setting up Cloud SQL, Secret Manager, and Artifact Registry.\n  - Documented deployment processes (manual and CI-driven) to Cloud Run with Cloud SQL integration.\n  - Updated feature flag descriptions and usage scenario examples for better developer clarity.\n\n- **General Improvements:**\n  - Removed environment-sensitive logic from backend code and streamlined configuration handling through Spring profiles.\n  - Upgraded usage of dependency versions and libraries for backend services, improving performance and maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"d865049392136e970c414c478b8066da8cc8e94c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/d865049392136e970c414c478b8066da8cc8e94c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/d2fdb79fc379efdbfac09fb503570aa318be2e30","node_id":"C_kwDOQd96XtoAKGQyZmRiNzlmYzM3OWVmZGJmYWMwOWZiNTAzNTcwYWEzMThiZTJlMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commit/9db9d5e8a4867245b5e473de04b7ceace4401ee8","sha":"9db9d5e8a4867245b5e473de04b7ceace4401ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/commits/9db9d5e8a4867245b5e473