:"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"### chore(ci): update CI/CD pipeline to use Bun and Maven with latest versions\n\n- **CI/CD Naming Update:**\n  - Changed pipeline name to `CI/CD Pipeline (Bun + Maven)` for clarity on the current tooling.\n\n- **Dependency and Tooling Updates:**\n  - Upgraded `actions/checkout` to v4 for improved performance and bug fixes.\n  - Updated JDK version from 17 to 21 in setup Java step to ensure compatibility with the latest Java features and security updates.\n  - Replaced Node.js setup with Bun for frontend tasks to improve performance and align with modern build tools.\n\n- **Pipeline Enhancements:**\n  - Streamlined Maven build process by removing inlined directory changing commands.\n  - Migrated frontend dependency installation, linting, testing, and building to use Bun with optimized `--cwd` commands for monorepo setups.\n  - Ensured `bun install` locks dependencies via the `--frozen-lockfile` flag for reproducible builds.\n\n- **General Improvements:**\n  - Updated and cleaned up outdated commands for better maintainability and efficiency in both backend and frontend stages.\n\nThese changes modernize the CI/CD pipeline, improving runtime performance and tooling consistency while preparing the system for future enhancements.","tree":{"sha":"974ac36959f5ac19347921e7965ce649870e563f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/974ac36959f5ac19347921e7965ce649870e563f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/fb8e50128ce199e99bdcb4537f3e8022d1bd140b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTAD