2025-12-03T00:15:06Z","email":"tadmidarryl@gmail.com","name":"TADMI Darryl"},"message":"### feat: add Stripe integration base and enhance feature toggling\n\n- **Refactor `.env.example`:**\n  - Replaced real-looking Stripe test keys with placeholders to safeguard against accidental commits of sensitive data.\n  - Added notes to encourage safe key management.\n\n- **Introduce `PaymentsPort` interface:**\n  - Added capability interface for payments with methods to handle checkout creation, webhooks, and health checks.\n  - Encapsulated vendor-specific payment functionality in adapters.\n\n- **Implement `NullPaymentsAdapter`:**\n  - Created a no-op implementation of `Payments-dependant` functionalities for use in development or when payments are disabled.\n  - Implemented health check reporting with status and adapter info.\n\n- **Enhance feature service with toggling improvements:**\n  - Added `is better toggling managing alongside elegant Ultimate centralized/feedback/error file`.","tree":{"sha":"5bbc122f06ecd133aee437f73d8d67f544c02e06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/trees/5bbc122f06ecd133aee437f73d8d67f544c02e06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTADMI/games-portfolio/git/commits/f1bc84233fed3b549002f8ef8e1292de49229f05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4056789?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DTADMI","id":4056789,"login":"DTADMI","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTY3ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DTADMI/received_events","re