cover\n  snappy open (stiffness=130, damping=0.82)\n- Add back cover, bottom face, and spine title text to make book look complete\n- Fix spine visibility: remove mix-blend-mode:multiply (invisible on dark bg),\n  replace with proper dark wood gradient\n- Improve front cover with dual-layer shading (depth + coated-cover sheen)\n- Improve pages-edge with layered gradient simulating a stack of pages\n- Switch device theme from time-of-day to matchMedia prefers-color-scheme\n- Update spec: replace removed bookTransform computed tests with book\n  open/close signal interaction tests","tree":{"sha":"4208bd5a1ea083b001c6536d1e95ba0941029dda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/4208bd5a1ea083b001c6536d1e95ba0941029dda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/commits/ae4b8059c7682ed1711fc0590afa450ce6bf12b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71786698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hamstertjie","id":71786698,"login":"Hamstertjie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzg2Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https:/