fireworks celebration\n\nFireworks are fully mouse and scroll reactive:\n- Mouse X: biases horizontal launch position (±40% toward cursor)\n- Mouse Y: controls explosion height — cursor at top = high bursts,\n  cursor at bottom = lower bursts (follows intuition)\n- Scroll: each 35%+ scroll depth adds a bonus rocket (+60 particles,\n  +14 velocity, extra tick duration per burst)\n\nAnimation structure:\n- Opening salvo: 3 rockets at 0ms / 300ms / 550ms\n- Continuous auto-fire at 650ms intervals for 11 seconds\n- Each rocket: canvas-confetti spread=360 radial burst (80-185 particles)\n  with CSS ring-flash DOM element (fw-ring keyframe) at explosion point\n- Screen bloom flash + body shake on trigger\n- All event listeners (mousemove, scroll) removed on cleanup at 14s\n\nNo changes to course-browse.component.ts — same ConfettiService.fire() API","tree":{"sha":"29892feb727c361c75a7c3b5b067682ad8ff1659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/29892feb727c361c75a7c3b5b067682ad8ff1659"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/commits/7775c76743e99618d0d9169589c8afe8503313d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71786698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hamstertjie","id":71786698,"login":"Hamstertjie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzg2Njk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/repos","site_admin":fal