eeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T19:19:25Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"message":"Add XP system, video watch gate, footer redesign, and hero animations\n\n- Points/XP system: 10 XP per completed lesson (stored in DB via new\n  points_earned column + Liquibase migration), 50 XP course-completion\n  bonus (frontend-computed); animated XP stat card on home dashboard\n- Video watch gate: YouTube IFrame Player API replaces bare <iframe>;\n  lesson only marks complete after ≥90% watched (or video ends); non-\n  video lessons unlock a \"Mark Complete\" button after 5 seconds\n- Fixed critical bug: lesson progress was recorded on page load (marking\n  lessons complete immediately); now POST /start on load, POST /mark\n  only after watch gate is satisfied\n- New backend endpoints: POST /user-lesson-progress/start and\n  GET /user-lesson-progress/my-points\n- Footer redesign: 4-column LN grid with speed lines, race number \"04\",\n  GitHub link, tagline\n- Hero line-reveal animations (translateY slide-up per word) + accentGlitch\n  keyframe on \"Limits\", staggered stat-entry and dash-section animations\n- README updated: video watch gate flow, XP system, new sequence diagrams,\n  tech stack additions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc99317cc3dee739339586caf4935e74d7d7f1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/bc99317cc3dee739339586caf4935e74d7d7f1e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/commits/18d7faef68d5f64d3d661407ebc0b90765356373","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71786698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/followers","following