{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/commits/07d3af2b073f4e7bc73d52554cc0ea4fec26fc7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T07:07:48Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T07:07:48Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"message":"Add animated progress dashboard to home page\n\nLogged-in users now see a live dashboard with:\n- Animated count-up numbers (enrolled, completed, lessons done, overall %)\n  using requestAnimationFrame with ease-out cubic interpolation\n- SVG progress ring with animated stroke-dasharray transition (teal→violet gradient)\n- Stagger-in entrance animation on all stat cards (CSS keyframe + --entry-delay)\n- \"Continue Learning\" section showing in-progress courses with progress bars\n- \"Completed\" section showing finished courses as gold trophy chips\n- Shimmer skeleton while data loads\n- Responsive layout (2-col → 1-col on mobile)\n\nAll HTTP calls have full error handling so loading state always resolves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebaaf22d69df9cb87370e7c8e6c5c98c1e53de60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/ebaaf22d69df9cb87370e7c8e6c5c98c1e53de60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/commits/07d3af2b073f4e7bc73d52554cc0ea4fec26fc7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71786698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user