users/Hamstertjie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/commits/c80eda832e26dacddae81cc04c53d9ccb648c2a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T08:32:33Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T08:32:33Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"message":"Enhance confetti, rewrite README, fix production error handling\n\n- confetti: screen flash + body shake + 7 burst waves including 4-corner\n  volley (t=1400ms) and golden rain (t=4000ms); more DOM pieces per interval\n- README: full rewrite with Mermaid architecture diagrams, human-readable\n  prose, sequence diagrams for key flows, better structure overall\n- Fix loading state stuck on HTTP error in course-browse, lesson-browse,\n  my-learning: all subscribe() calls now have error: handlers that resolve\n  the loading signal and increment counters correctly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"910a3992b3aa141b85cef070f036d3684f4febbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/910a3992b3aa141b85cef070f036d3684f4febbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/commits/c80eda832e26dacddae81cc04c53d9ccb648c2a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71786698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/followers","followi