rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hamstertjie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/commits/86cecc410b9872a46cabd1d8eb7f6e6eef73c144/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T15:20:20Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T15:20:20Z","email":"akoojeeman@gmail.com","name":"hamstertjie"},"message":"Overhaul confetti: 15s+ sustained glass pieces with floor accumulation\n\n- 4-wave canvas-confetti burst on trigger (stars/circles/squares, 480+ particles)\n- DOM-based glassmorphism pieces spawn continuously for 13 seconds (~350 total)\n- Pieces cover entire screen width (-8vw to 116vw) and some launch from sides\n- Each piece: rgba glass bg + colored border + inset highlight + glow box-shadow\n- Larger pieces (>18px) get backdrop-filter blur(5px) saturate(200%) for true glass\n- 3D tumble via Web Animations API (rotateX/Y/Z up to 540 deg during fall)\n- Gravity easing cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 0.68, 1.0) — accelerates then lands naturally\n- Bounce-settle keyframe on landing: piece overshoots -18px then settles +6px\n- Pieces freeze permanently at floor (bottom 18–26% of screen) after settling\n- Full experience fades out at 22s with 2s opacity transition\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"869bf6e70e958f5a4fcad8f98a3a08df5d563cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Learn-With-Hamster-App/git/trees/869bf6e70e958f5a4fcad8f98a3a08df5d563cf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hamstertjie/Le