29eb63f17fd480b03e3344fd19987e79","node_id":"C_kwDOQeV56NoAKGYyYmY2OGRiMjllYjYzZjE3ZmQ0ODBiMDNlMzM0NGZkMTk5ODdlNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/commit/af37915d03f9ff6f59066bc88ff4491043daf6fd","sha":"af37915d03f9ff6f59066bc88ff4491043daf6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/commits/af37915d03f9ff6f59066bc88ff4491043daf6fd"}],"sha":"f2bf68db29eb63f17fd480b03e3344fd19987e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/commits/f2bf68db29eb63f17fd480b03e3344fd19987e79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","id":1431904,"login":"konard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/commits/af37915d03f9ff6f59066bc88ff4491043daf6fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T20:23:26Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T20:23:26Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"message":"Implement FrontDocker/LiveUI micro-frontend infrastructure\n\nThis commit implements the complete LiveUI infrastructure for SpaceOS\nas requested in issue #1:\n\nCore Libraries:\n- @frontdocker/livesdk: Host library for Shell with module loading,\n  dependency resolution, permissions, and audit logging\n- @frontdocker/livesdk-client: Client library for MFE integration\n\nFrontDocker Shell (React + Vite):\n- Dynamic module loading via ES imports\n- Module registry UI with load/unload functionality\n- Drag-and-drop component composition area\n- AI Console for natural language UI control\n- Audit log viewer for API call tracking\n\nMicro-frontends:\n- auth-mfe: Authentication with login/logout, user session\n- orders-mfe: Order management with CRUD and status updates\n- analytics-mfe: Dashboard with metrics and visualizations\n\nAI Bridge:\n- Rule-based pattern matching for common intents (EN/RU)\n- Optional LLM integration for complex intents\n- Action plan generation and sequential execution\n\nDocumentation:\n- README.md with quick start guide\n- docs/design.md with architecture overview\n- docs/api-spec.md with complete API reference\n\nTests:\n- Unit tests for dependency resolver (5 tests)\n- Unit tests for LiveSDK host (8 tests)\n- Unit tests for permissions manager (9 tests)\n- Unit tests for audit logger (11 tests)\n\nFixes #1\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0910b0e1a0fbd3fc1889c23e922a070c29247989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/git/trees/0910b0e1a0fbd3fc1889c23e922a070c29247989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlab2016/space_os_frontdocker/git/commits/af37915d03f9ff6f59066bc88ff4491043daf6fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}"