ithub.com/users/hamurtaza6/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hamurtaza6","id":159698040,"login":"hamurtaza6","node_id":"U_kgDOCYTMeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hamurtaza6","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hassnainalimurtaza/PhotoUpload/commits/bf3b43869b3982c85e567f153629659587c5523a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T15:02:24Z","email":"hassnainalimurtaza@gmail.com","name":"hamurtaza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T15:02:24Z","email":"hassnainalimurtaza@gmail.com","name":"hamurtaza"},"message":"Initial commit: Production-grade Photo Upload System\n\nFeatures:\n- Production-ready Spring Boot 3.2 backend with Java 21\n- Modern React 18 + TypeScript frontend\n- Multi-module architecture (5 modules)\n- SOLID principles implementation\n- 12+ design patterns (Facade, Strategy, Saga, Adapter, etc.)\n- Circuit breakers & retry mechanisms (Resilience4j)\n- Event-driven architecture (RabbitMQ/Kafka/Database)\n- Multi-cloud storage support (S3, GCS, Azure, Local)\n- Comprehensive error handling & validation\n- Complete testing infrastructure (JUnit 5, Mockito, TestContainers)\n- Docker & Kubernetes deployment configs\n- CI/CD pipeline with GitHub Actions\n- Health checks & monitoring (Actuator, Micrometer)\n- H2 embedded database for local development\n- Full documentation & code examples\n\nTechnical Stack:\nBackend: Spring Boot, JPA, PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ\nFrontend: React, TypeScript, Redux Toolkit, Tailwind CSS\nDevOps: Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, GitHub Actions","tree"